(naṃ0 5294 )
(agastya saṃhitā)
(patra 46)
(viṣayaḥ tantram)

<pṛ0 1a> oṃsvastiśrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ oṃnamaḥ śrīrāmāya oṃagastyonāmadevarṣisattamogautamītaṭe kadāciddaṃḍakāraṇyesu
tīkṣṇasyāśramaṃyayau pratyuñja(?)gāmataṃbhaktyāgaṃdhapuṣpākṣatodakaiḥ pādyārghāyarhaṇaṃcakre tasmaivrahmavidemuniḥ sutīkṣṇa
staṃpraṇamyāha sukhāsīnaṃtaponidhiṃ śrīmadāgamanenaivajīvitaṃsaphalaṃmama adyajanmasahasreṇatapaḥphalativāṃkṣitaṃ
kāmakrodhādibhirbhūyaḥsadāhaṃpīḍitomune nādrākṣyaṃsamyagiṣṭvāpikratubhirbhūridakṣiṇaiḥ satpātresarvadānānidattvāpimu
nisattama bhavāvdhestaraṇeyājaṃtapastaptvāpiduḥkaram kiṃkariṣyāmyahaṃtātakvayāsyāmicamevada ityuktaḥsovravīttena
kuṃbhabhūvigataspṛhaḥ kṣaṇaṃvicāryatatpaurvāparyeṇamunipuṃgavaḥ agastyuvāca astivakṣyāmitesarvaṃrahasyaṃvṛṣabhadhva
jaḥ yatpratyayādayatpūrvaṃpārvatyaikṛpayātmavit īśvaruvāca kāmakrodhādibhirdoṣairduṣṭāstatrapunaḥpunaḥ utpadyaṃtepra
līyaṃtepunarvyāmohitāstathā rauravāṃdiṣupacyaṃtepunaḥsaṃsāriṇobhuvi karmaśeṣātprajāyaṃtepagvaṃdhavadhirādayaḥ kṛ
mikīṭādayobhūtvāpunaḥsaṃsāriṇobhuvi kuṣṭādyupahatākeciccauravyāghrādibhirhatāḥ praviśaṃtijalegnauvādeśāddeśaṃvra
jaṃtivā parastrīdhanahartārastāpayaṃtisataḥsadā devavrāhmaṇavittaistuyevāṃjīvanamanvahaṃ rājasastāmasāyecahaṃtāro
vanajīvinaḥ putradārādibhiryuktāduḥkhāvartebhramaṃtyaho kalaupāyeṇasarvepirājasāstāmasāstathā niṣiddhācari(-)

<pṛ0 1ba> ṇaḥsaṃtomohayaṃtyaparānvahūn yathābhūtaḥprabhurlokesevakāḥsyustathāvidhāḥ atomadīyāḥsarve(..) hiṃsakāsyuḥpriyā
priye vaśyākarṣaṇavidveṣastaṃbhanoccāṭanādiṣu śaśvadāvāṃsamārādhyabhavaṃtiphalabhāginaḥ āvābhyāṃpiśitaṃraktaṃ
surāṃvāpisureśvari varṇāśramocitaṃdharmmamavicāryāprayaṃtiye bhūtapretapiśācāsībhavaṃtivrahmarākṣasāḥ punastadaṃ
tejāyaṃteviprāvedādhikāriṇaḥ natadrūpeṇajāyaṃtesvasvadoṣānurūpataḥ pārvatyuvāca nāyaṃdharmohideveśapareṣā
mupakārakṛt atomevrūhideveśadharmoyastaṃkṛpānidheḥ īśvaruvāca satyaṃvadāmyahaṃdeviyanmāṃtvaṃparipṛchasi haṃ
tāhaṃsarvalokānāmatohaṃsaivamepriyā yevābhūtāninighnaṃtividhināvidhināpivā samarppayaṃtibhūtebhyomatpriyāste
sadāpriye ahaṃtamopayonityaṃhanmibhūtānibhāvini matkarmahananaṃyasmāttatohiṃsaivamepriyā matkṛtyācāriṇaḥ
sarvevallabhāmamavallabhe lokāsvāmyanurūpeṇasevāṃkurvaṃtisevakāḥ bhaktyāparyaṃtiyemahyaṃtavāpipiśitādikam
utpādayaṃticānaṃdamaṃgebhyopi sureśvari tavāpiyemadīyānāmasmākaṃpiśitādikaṃ tṛptimutpādayaṃtyevavidhināvidhinā
rpitaṃ vrahmāsṛjatibhūtāniviṣṇustānyevapālayet tānyahaṃhanmibhūtānikṛtirasmākamīdṛśīṃ rajoguṇālayovrahmā
viṣṇuḥsattvaguṇālayaḥ tamoguṇālayohaṃsmasvasvakarmāṇiku..he tattadguṇānuguṇyenakṛyatesmābhirīdṛśaṃ bhavavdhe
staraṇaṃdevi hiṃsakānāṃsudurlabhaṃ kāmādigrahacittānāṃkutomuktirvadapriye (39) || itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃ

<pṛ0 2a> [prathamodhyāyaḥ] (1) || pārvatyuvāca kimupāsyalabhenmuktiṃkriyayāvākriyāprabho mumulloḥpunarāvṛttidurlabhaṃbhavabhaṃjanaṃ
īśvaruvāca śṛṇudevimahābhāgerahasyaṃkathayāmite yajjñātvāmucyatejaṃturjanmasaṃsārabaṃdhanāt apāṇipādojavanogṛ
hītvāpīkṣatopyadṛk akarṇaḥsaśṛṇotyevaśavdarūpaṃparaṃmahaḥ vettivedyaṃsasarvajñairavedyovedyatoprabhuḥ samahāpuruṣaḥpuṃṣāṃstrī
ṇāṃpuṃvyaktilakṣaṇaḥ strīpuṃnapuṃsakākārarahitaḥpuruṣottamaḥ sarveśvaraḥsarvarūpaḥsarvadevamayohariḥ satyajñānamayonaṃto
nādirānaṃdavigrahaḥ ajaḥsmaraṇamātreṇajanmādikleśabhaṃjanaḥ tasyātmanādhīḥsarveṣāṃpunarāvartikartinī niyamenaivava
rṇānāṃsvāśramoktenasaprabhuḥ dhyeyaḥsaṃsāranāśāyanacaivāvartatepunaḥ svāśramoktaṃparityajyātmānamupāsate tadrūpe
ṇanatedevimucyaṃtebhavabaṃdhanāt śrutismṛtipurāṇeṣuyoyoniyamucyate yasyayasyāśramepālyo namuktavyomumukṣubhiḥ
atoniyamamādṛtyakuryāddhyānamananyadhīḥ etaccarācaraṃviśvaṃsvapnapratyayavatsudhīḥ mithyādṛgvyatiriktaṃyaddṛśyatvā(-)
vāyathāpriye dṛgrūpeṇātmanātmānaṃvijñānaparikalpitaṃ etatsvavyatiriktaṃyatsatyānaṃdātmanaḥsvayaṃ ekākīyatacittātmā
ciṃtayettadananyadhīḥ sohamityātmanātmānasvājñānaparikalpitaṃ etatsvavyatiriktaṃyadyataḥsvenaivakalpayet napāramārthi
kaṃdeviyadyasyālopikalpayet vālākṣayohikābhedaḥkalpatetattvacakṣuṣā astaṃpaṃthāḥpurāṇasyādanuvṛttaḥpurātanaiḥ adhyā
tmavidbhiraṃrvācojñāpitāḥsaparāḥsmṛtāḥāvrahmaśuddhavaṃśānāṃmātāpitrokulocaye nastriyovyabhicāriṇyaḥpuruṣāścaivadhā(-)

<pṛ0 2ba> rmikāḥ yajñāścavedādhyayinaṃsevaṃtepratipūruṣaṃ pūjyaṃtetiyayoyatraguruśiṣyaparaṃparā svāpeṣuskhalatenaivastriṣvapivrahma
cāriṣu niyamopyāśramasteṣukadācidapibhāvini tatkāleṣutudānānitadārthibhyaḥpradīyate yeṣuvaṃśeṣusarveṣāṃteṣā
mevaprakāśayet vrahmavrahmavidāṃdeviguruśikṣopaśikṣayā svayamevaparaṃbrahmatatonyaṃnāstikiṃcana tadetadakhilaṃvrahma
satyaṃsatyaṃprakāśyate janmakoṭisahasreṣuprakṣāṇāṃśeṣakilviṣaiḥ kaścidevaniyamyāśūnaparokṣaṃnirīkṣyate sukhāmṛ
tarasāsvādasatyaikajñānarūpatā bhāgadheyenaviduṣāsvayamevānubhūyate ahopuṇyamahaudharmonātaḥparataraṃpriye akṛ
teṣvapisarveṣuprāyaścittamidaṃparaṃ (24) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃ dvitīyodhyāyaḥ] || (2) || pārvatyuvāca || 
sarvajñasarvalokeśasarvaduḥkhanisūdana sarveṣāṃsugamaḥpaṃthākomevadadayānidhe īśvaruvāca śṛṇuṣvāvahitodeviya
detatpratipadyate sarveśvaraḥsarvamayaḥsarvabhūtahiterataḥ sarveṣāmupakārāyasākarobhūnnirākṛtiḥ sabhaktavatsaloloke
svayamevaviceṣṭate bhaktānurūpayādevoduḥkhasukhamivānubhūt yadāyadācabhūtānāṃbhayamutpadyatetadā tattadbhayavighā
tāyayattadbhūyovyajāyata matsyakūrmavarāhādirūpeṇaparamārthadṛk tattatkāleṣusaṃbhūyasarveṣāmapyapākarot sā
dhūnāmāśramāṇāṃcabhaktānāṃbhaktavatsala upakartānirākārastadākāreṇajāyate ajoyaṃjāyatenaṃtaḥśāṃtobhūdbhū
tabhāvanaḥkadācidavatīrthoyaṃsadabhuktānukaṃpayā kṣīrāvdhedevadeveśolakṣmīnārāyaṇobhuvi saśeṣaḥśaṃkhacakrābhyāṃ

<pṛ0 3a> devairvrahmādibhiḥsaha tretāyugedāśarathibhūtvānārāyaṇobabhau śeṣobhūllakṣmaṇāṃlakṣmīḥśaṃkhacakrecajānakī jātaubharata
śatrughnaudevāḥsarvepivānarāḥ babhūvurevaṃsarvepidevarṣibhayaśāṃtaye tatranārāyaṇodevaḥ śrīrāmitiviśrutaḥ sarvalo
kopakārāyabhūmausoyamavātarat tapaḥkurvaṃtitaṃkecidaparokṣaṃnirīkṣituṃ paṃcāgnimadhyegrīṣmetuvarṣāsubhuviśerate
śiśireṣujaleṣvevaṃtataḥkecanatepire kecidbhikṣāṃparyyaṭaṃtikṛtvādhāraṇapāraṇaṃ śoṣayaṃtipunardehamaparekṛcchracaryya
yā kālaścāṃdrāyaṇenaivakecitpārvatinīyate śākamevāparedehamaśnaṃtaḥśeṣayaṃtyaho ihakecidurārohonaktapāca
kabhojakāḥ ciṃtayaṃticiraṃtattvavaneṣvekevdinehṛdi ananyamanasaḥśaśvadgaṇayaṃtyakṣamānvayā jayaṃtorāmarāmetisva
dhāmaninidhaumanaḥ pravilīyāṃmṛtībhūyasukhaṃtiṣṭaṃtikecana matpaścimābhimukhyenakecitprāsādikevare bhāvayaṃ
ticiraṃdevibhagavānprāptayevudhāḥ paricaryyāparāḥkecitprāsādeṣvevaśerate manuṣyavimataṃdraṣṭaṃvivahartuṃcabaṃdhuvat 
adhyāpanāyavidyānāṃyoddhamapyapareta(....) cakrirevairiṇobhūtvākecidveṣyeṣutepire kṣīrāhārāṣyareṣvavdestīreṣvevaniṣe
vire caṃcalākṣathakeṣāṃcittapaḥsmartaṃnaśakyate kiṃkariṣyatidevoyaṃravaṃdṛṣṭvāsudāruṇaṃ tapastapasvināmetatkṛpayā
nugrahādiha mānuṣīṃbhūyasarveṣāṃbhaktānāṃbhaktavatsalaḥ dhyānamātreṇadeveśimahāpātakanāśakṛtkīrtanasmaraṇā
devahatyākoṭinivāraṇaḥ rāmarāmetirāmetiyevadaṃtyepipāpinaḥ pāpakoṭisahasrebhyastānuddharatinānyathā

<pṛ0 3ba> ugreṇatapasāteṣāṃsobhūdevaṃdayānidhiḥ yatovāconivadatimanobhiḥsahayogināṃ bhāgadheyenasarveṣāṃsapratyakṣamatā
yata ahobhāgyātirekeṇamanuṣyoyaṃvyavāharan tapodadātisaubhāgyaṃtapovidyāṃprayacchati tapasādurlabhaṃkiṃcinnā
stibhāvinidehināṃ avāptasarvakāmopivāṃmanogocarevibhuḥ manuṣyivamānuṣyamādāyabhuvimodate ahokṛpāti
rekeṇasarvaṃcasamupaitivai etasmidapikiṃlābhādadhikaṃgajagāminī tapodhanaṃtapobhāgyaṃtapaḥsarvatrasiddhidaṃ atasta
pasvināṃdevidāsatvamapidurlabhaṃ ||    || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃtṛtīyodhyāyaḥ] (3) || pārvatyuvāca
yogīṃdravaṃdyacaraṇadvaṃdvānaṃdaikalakṣaṇaṃ kathamevamupāsyainaṃbhaktiṃsarvepibhejire tadetadvrūhideveśayadyastikaruṇāmayi
īśvaruvāca hiraṇyagarbhasiddhāṃtaṃrahasyamanaghaiśṛṇu yajjñātvāmucyatemohāddaurbhāgyavyādhisaṃcayāt bhadretadānidā
syāmitatsāragrāhiṇīmama pūrvaṃvrahmātapastepekalpakoṭiśatatrayaṃ munīṃdraiḥvahubhiḥsārddhaṃduddharṣānaśanavrataṃ puraskṛ
tyāgnimadhyasthastadārādhanatatparaḥ ādarātiśayenasyanairaṃtaryyārcanādinā cirāyadevadevopipratyakṣamabhavattadā kiṃca
puṇyātirekeṇa sarveṣāṃtasyacapriye navanīlāṃvudaśyāmaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ śaṃkhacakragadāpadmajaṭāmukuṭamaṃḍi
taḥ kirīṭahārakeyūra ratnakuṃḍalaśobhitaḥ saṃtaptakāṃcanaprakhyapītavāsoyugānvitaḥ tejomayaḥsūryasomavidyudu(-)
lkāgnikoṭayaḥ mīlitvābhirbhavaṃtīvaprādurāsītpuraḥprabhuḥ staṃbhībhūyatadāvrahmākṣaṇaṃtasthauvimohitaḥ tuṣṭāvamuni

<pṛ0 4a> bhiḥsārddhaṃpraṇamyacapunaḥpunaḥ dhanyosmikṛtakṛtyosmikṛtāthosmihabaṃdhubhiḥ prasattosīhabhagavānjīvitaṃsaphalaṃmama ka
thaṃstoṣyāmyahaṃdevaṃbhagavanniticiṃtayan ṛgyajuḥsamavedaiścaśāstraibahubhirādarāt sarvaiḥmanvādibhiddharmapratipādanatatparaiḥ
tuṣṭāveśvaramabhyarcyasaṃtuṣṭomunibhiḥpunaḥ tvamevaviśvataścakṣurviśvatomukhucyate viśvatobāhurekaḥsanviśvataṣpāttathāparaḥ
janayanbhūrbhuvaulokausvarlokaiḥsarvaśāsakaḥ akṣabhyāmapibāhubhyāṃkarmabhyāṃbhuvanatrayaṃ padbhyāṃcanāsikābhyāṃtusarvaṃsa
rvatrapaśyasi samādhatseśṛṇoṣvetatsarvaṃgachasisarvakṛt jighrasyaivanatekiṃcidavijñātaṃprabhosmiha vrahmāviṣṇuścarudraścatva
mevananukeśava sahasraśīrṣaḥpuruṣaḥsahasrākṣaḥsahasrapāt pṛthivyaptejasorūpaṃmarudākāśayorapi kāryyaṃkartākṛ
tirdevakāraṇatvaṃhikevalaṃ aṇoraṇīyānmahatomahīyānmadhyataḥsvayaṃ madhyosinirvikalposiyastvāṃdevānugacchati
evamādibahustotraistutaḥsaparameśvaraḥ vaidikaiḥkṛpayāviṣṇurbrahmāṇamidamavravīt stutastuṣṭosmitevrahmanugreṇata
pasādhanā vṛṇīṣvayadabhīṣṭaṃtedāsyāmikamalodbhavaḥ ityuktaḥsovravīttenaviṣṇunāprabhaviṣṇunā tuṣṭosiyadideveśa
dāsyaṃmesvīkariṣyasi abhīṣṭaṃdevadevaśayadyastikaruṇāmayi asaubhāgyenadāridryaduḥkhenāhaṃsuduḥkhitāḥ pratibhā
ticadeveśasarvamasmākamīdṛśam kiṃkariṣyāmideveśavrūhimepuruṣottama kāmakrodhādibhirdoṣairduṣṭāsarvāpimepra
jā pūrvājitaviśeṣeṇanakaścidavaśiṣyate kovopāyomanuṣyāṇāṃbhaktānāṃbhaktavatsala etaccharīrapātāṃte naparaṃmu

<pṛ0 4ba> ktisiddhaye etaduktaḥ sadevosmaibhuktimuktiprasiddhaye kiṃcidvicāryakṛpayāṣaḍakṣaramupāviśat ekaikavarṇavinyāsaṃ
kramaṃcāṃgāniṣaṭpunaḥ tadvidhiṃvidhayeprādādyaṃtraṃmaṃtrākṣarāṇica rahasyaṃdevadevopitanmithaḥsamavodhayan tasyatatprā
ptimātreṇatadānīmevatatphalaṃ sarvādhipatyaṃsarvajñabhavopyasyābhavattadā kiṃcāsyabhagavatvaṃcayadiṣṭaṃtadabhūdapi sa
rveśvaraprasādenatapasākinnalabhyate munīnāmapisarveṣāṃtadāvrahmātadājñayā upādhideśatatsarvaṃtatastaṃviṣṇuravravī
t ṛṣirbhavāsyamaṃtrasyavrahmantvaṃsarvamaṃtravit rāmohaṃdevatāchaṃdogāyatrīchaṃdasāṃparā māṃtoyāṃtobhavedvījamādya
mādyaphalapradaḥ namaḥśaktitayodiṣṭonamoṃtomaṃtranāyakaḥ rāmāyamadhyamovrahmansarvaṃtasmainivedayan ihabhukti
ścamuktiścadehāṃtesaṃbhaviṣyati yadanyadapibhīṣṭaṃsyāttatprasādātprajāyate anvatiṣṭādareṇaivaniraṃtaramananyadhīḥ
ciraṃmadgatacittastvaṃmāmevārādhayecciraṃ māmevamanasādhyāyanmāmaivaiṣyasinānyathā sūtraṃtadetadvistāryyaśiṣyebhyovrū
hivistarāt ityuktoṃtardadhedevastatraivakamalekṣaṇaḥ prajāpatiścabhagavānmunibhiḥ sārddhamanvahaṃ anvatiṣṭadvidhānā
tiniḥkṣipyājñāśirasyatha vrahmātadābhīsarveṣāmupadeṣṭābabhūvaha āryetavāpitenaivasarvābhīṣṭaṃbhaviṣyati (40) || 
[itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃcaturthodhyāyaḥ] (4) || sutīkṣṇuvāca purātanapurāṇajñasarvajñānārthavittama tata
ṣkimakarodvipraśreṣṭāgastyāvikātadā īśvaraṣkenarūpeṇatāmetāmavavodhayat agastyuvāca tadāhihṛdayerāmaṃni

<pṛ0 5a> dhāyakamalekṣaṇā muktayeniścinotismatamananyaparāyaṇā hiraṇyagarbhasiddhāṃtarahasyaśravaṇātparaṃ kāmādigrasta
tātatstāciramevanyavartata īśvarastāṃpriyāṃsamyajñānamātreṇasaṃsthitāṃ nyavartatatatojñātvāsaṃsārochitivāṃchayā
tāmavravītsabhagavānīśvaraḥsarvakāmadhuk mūlaprakṛtirāryyetvaṃpuruṣohaṃsanātanaḥ kāraṇaṃjagadutpattestatvaṃtada
nuvekṣaṇaṃ kurvahesyāttaduchittiryyadikiṃtaddhitaṃtava kalpāṇimamakiṃtulyamā(..)ryyonatutatparaṃ kāryyaṃhikāraṇā
bhāvekutrasaṃpadyatevada āvayoḥsaṃbhaviṣyaṃtisatokalpāṇidevatāḥ tvatprasādādidaṃsarvaṃ nakadācidbhaviṣyati
evaṃvasatikiṃdevisarvaṃtyaktumapekṣyase nayuktametatkimapityaktuṃdevyadhunātvayā ityuktāsāvravīddevīṃnīlotpa
ladalekṣaṇā prāṇanāthā (...) kimmekartavyamitisāvravīt iyaṃsadvāsanāmattonaivotsattābhavatprabho kadācida(-)
pimenāthatvaṃtathātugṛhāṇamā tathoktaḥsavravīdenāṃhimādritanayāṃpunaḥ śrīrāmārādhanaṃdevitadarthaṃprativāsare 
ārādhanopakaraṇairanyathāmākṛthāḥpriye etenaivabhayaṃkiṃcidihāmutrabhaviṣyati kalausaṃkīrtanenaivasarvāghaughaṃvina
śyati ārādhanenasaṃgenagaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ kiṃvaktavyaṃpriyesarvaṃmanasāciṃtitaṃcayat evamārādhanenaivabhavi
ṣyatinacānyathā nagṛhījñānamātreṇaparatrehacamaṃgalaṃ prāpnoticaṃdravadanedānahemādibhirvinā gṛhasthoyadidānā
ninadadyājjuhudādapi pūjayedvidhinānaivakaḥkuryādetadanvahaṃ navrahmacāriṇodātumadhikārostibhāviniguru(-)

<pṛ0 5ba> bhyoratrasarvabhyaḥkovādāsyatpapekṣitaṃ nāraṇyavāsināṃśaktirnnatesaṃtikalauyuge parivrāḍjñānamātreṇadānahomā
dibhirvinā sarvaduḥkhapiśācebhyomuktobhavatinānyathā parivrāḍaviraktaścaviraktaścagṛhītathā kuṃbhīpākonima
jjetetāvubhaukamalānane puṇyāstriyogṛhasthāścamaṃgalemaṃgalārthinaḥ pūjopakaraṇairdadyurdānānibahucārhaṇāṃ caṃda
nāgurukastūrīsakarpūrahimāṃśubhiḥ paṃcāmṛtābhiṣekeścapuṣpaistāmarasairapi puṣpamālyaiścabahubhirdūrvābhiścākṣa
taissaha nīlotpallairmallikābhiṣkaravīraiścacaṃpakaiḥ jātīprasūtairvilvaiścapuṃnnāgairbakulairapi kadalīketakīpuṣpai
rvāruṇāśokakiṃśukaiḥ nāgarānādipuṣpaiścagaṃdhavadbhirmanoharaiḥ pratyugraiṣkomalaiścaivapūjayeyuḥprayatnataḥ pallavaścaiva
patraiścajalasthasthalasaṃbhavaiḥ evamādibhiranyaiścapuṣpairvahubhiranvahaṃ samyaksaṃpādyayatnenayathāśaktyāranūttamam
trikālamekakālaṃvāpūjayeyuraharniśaṃ atyādṛtairbahuvidhaiḥpiṣṭakairiṣṭasiddhaye kṣīranīrājyapakvaiścaphenāpūpava
ṭādibhiḥ dadhyodanāttapānīyaiḥ sūpādivyaṃjanairapi vaṭīvaṭopaśokādipadārthairvahuvistaraiḥ ārārtikairdhūpadīpai
ṣaḍāvṛtyupakalpitaiḥ bahubhidīpamālābhirarcayeyuraharniśaṃ kaṃkolailāpūgaphalaistathājātīphalairapi karpūracū
rṇasahitaistāṃbalaiścasuvāsitaiḥ marhāherarhaṇaṃkuryyuka (...)nyārthītayānvahaṃ svasyaśaktyānusāreṇasarvasaṃpādya
yatnataḥ grahasthānāṃvidhirayaṃnetareṣāṃvarānane dadyurdānānijuhuyurarcitegnauśubhārthinaḥ kalyāṇaṃcavarāroheṇarāmārpa

<pṛ0 6a> ṇadhiyānvahaṃ evaṃgṛhasthaniyamaṃstathaivavrahmacāriṇāṃ vidhimapyanatikramyayathāśaktyanusārataḥ yadikuryyuḥprayatnena
pūjātatsādhanairiha sarvasaṃpadyateteṣāṃdevānāṃdurlabhaṃcayat kalyāṇiśuddhamacchakyaṃyadikalyāṇamicchasi rāmamā
rādhanādyātiyāvajjīvaṃyathāvidhi etenaivavarārohekalyāṇaṃtavasarvadā puṇyastriyogṛhasthā(-.)tathaivavrahmacāriṇaḥ
sagaṇaṃrāmamārādhyapūrvoktaiḥsādhanairapi śaktyāsaṃpāditaitkaiścitpūjayeyurdivāniśaṃ teṣāṃbhuktiścamuktiścabhavatyevana
cānyathā vānaprasthāścayatayoyadyevaṃkuryuranvahaṃ saṃsārānnanivartaṃtevidyatikramadoṣataḥ ārūḍhapatitohyetebhaveyuḥ
duḥkhabhāginaḥ ahiṃsāparamodharmasteṣāmeṣānapaddhatiḥ nahiṃsāvyatirekeṇalabhyaṃtetānitānivai bhavanākalpitaiḥ
pūjāsādhanairevapūjyate navahiryyogayuktānāṃmatasteṣāṃpraśasyate etacchaṃdodhiyāmevasevyatebahurūpataḥ dhyānamapya
rcanābhadrebhadrārthaphaladaṃyataḥ ātmanastattvacittāṃtutasyāpyātmānuciṃtanaṃ ubhayoraikyacittāṃtupunarāvartayennatu
ātmānaṃsatataṃrāmasaṃbhāvyaviharaṃtiye nateṣāṃduḥkṛtaṃkiṃciduṣkṛtotthānacāpadaḥ (44) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhi
tāyāṃpaṃcamodhyāyaḥ] || (5) || sutīkṣṇuvāca kimetadbhagavanvrūhihitvāmadhyāṃguliṃrahaḥ takraṃpivasimāhā
tmyaṃśrīḥtulasyāḥkvacitsmṛtaṃ agastyuvāca śṛṇuvakṣyāmimāhātmyaṃtulasyāccaprayatnataḥ pūrvamugratapaḥkṛtvā
varaṃvavretapasvinī tulasīsarvapuṣpebhyaḥpatrebhyovalabhāyataḥ viṣṇotrailokyanāthasyarāmasyajanakātmajā priyātathai

<pṛ0 6ba> vatulasīsarvalokaikapāvinī tulasīpatramātreṇayorcayedrāmamanvahaṃ sayātiśāśvataṃvrahmapunarāvṛttidurlabham 
nīlotpalasahasreṇapratyahaṃyorcayeddhariṃ phalaṃvarṣasahasreṇatadīyenaivalabhyate vidvānsarveṣupuṣpeṣupaṃkajaṃśreṣṭa
mucyate tatpuṣpeṣvapitanmālyaṃlakṣakoṭiguṇaṃbhavet viṣṇoḥśirasivinyastamekaṃśrītulasīdalaṃ anaṃtaphaladaṃvi
dvānmaṃtroścāraṇapūrvakaṃ puṣpāṃtarairaṃtaritaṃnirmitaṃtulasīdalaiḥ mālyaṃmalayajāliptaṃdadyācchrīrāmamūrddhani kiṃta
syavahubhiryajñaiḥsaṃpūrṇavaradakṣiṇaiḥ kiṃtīrthasevayādāmairugreṇatapasātathā vācāniyamyacātmānaṃmanoviṣṇaunidhā
yaca yorcayettulasīmālyairyajñakoṭiphalaṃlabhet bhavāvdhikūpamagnānāmetaduddhārakāṃkuśaṃ patraṃpuṣpaṃphalaṃcaivaśrīḥtula
syāḥ samarpitaṃ rāmāyamuktimārgasyadyotakaṃsarvasiddhidaṃ mālyānidadatelakṣmīkusumāṃtaritānica tulasyāḥsarvamā
nīya nirmitānitapodhana tulasīvāṭikāpuṣpapatrāṃtaraśatāvṛtā śobhaterāghavastatrasītayāḥsahitaḥsvayaṃ āro(-)
payaṃtitadbhaktyāsvayamevamanīṣiṇaḥ vanatvenasamāvṛtyakaṃṭakīstulasīdalaṃ athanānyuttadeveśinānyadabhyarhitaṃta
taḥ sālagrāmaśilātīrthaṃtulasīdalavāsitaṃ yepivaṃtipunasteṣāṃtulyapānaṃnavidyate gāṃgeyamivatoyeṣudeve
ṣvivaraghūttamaḥ sarojamivapuṣpeṣuśasyatetulasīdalaṃ saṃpūjyabhaktyāvidhivadrāmaṃśrītulasīdalaiḥ bhavāṃtarasa
hasreṣuduḥkhagrāhādvimucyate varṇāśrametarāṇāṃcapūjāyasyaivasādhanaṃ apekṣitārthadattānyajagatsvapitapodhana

<pṛ0 7a> pūjāyogyairdalaiḥpatraiḥpuṣpairvāyorcayeddhariṃ yāṃtinyūnātiriktānikarmāṇiphalitānyaho natasyanarakekleśoyorca
yettulasīdalaiḥ pāpiṣṭovāpyapāpiṣṭaḥsatyaṃsatyaṃnasaṃśayaḥ gaṃgātoyenatulasīdalayuktenayorcayet rāmaṃniḥkṣi
pyaśirasisamaṃtreṇasiṃcayet nimīlyacakṣuṣodhīrorāmaṃhṛdinidhāyaca asakṛdvasakṛdvāpiyevamanutiṣṭati
dhyeyobhavatisarveṣāṃmayamevavimuktaye nasatiguravoyasyānaivadīkṣāvidhikramaḥ rāmarakṣāṃvadaṃtecatulasīdalamarppa
yet dīkṣāṃtaraśatenāpinatatphalamavāpyate dīkṣīteṣvapisarveṣu rāmadīkṣituttamaḥ nagurunaivakālaṃścanade
vāṃtarapūjanam tulasīdalayuktaṃcarāmārcanamapekṣyate nirmālyatulasīmālyayuktoyadyarcayeddhariṃ yadyatkaroti
tatsarvaṃmanaṃtaphaladaṃbhavet yadyanyūnaṃbhavatyevasamārādhanasādhanaṃ tulasīpatramātreṇatyuktaṃtatparipūryate śālagrā
maśilāyāścagaṃgāyāścatapodhana tulasyāścaivamāhātmyaṃneṣṭevaktuṃhariḥsakṛt bhavabhaṃjanametaccasarvābhīṣṭaṃprayaccha
ti nātaḥparataraṃkiṃcitpāvanaṃbhuvividyate yaḥkuryyāttulasīkāṣṭyairakṣamālaṃsvarūpiṇīṃ varṇamālāṃprayatnenakṛṃtasyā
kṣayaṃbhavet saṃghṛṣṭyatulasīkāṣṭaṃyodadyādrāmamūrdhini karpūrāgurukastūrīcaṃdanaṃcanatatsamaṃ tulasīvipinassyāpi
samaṃtātpācanaṃsthalaṃ krośamātraṃbhavatyevagaṃgāyāḥsrotasoyathā tulasyāropitāsiktādṛṣṭvāspṛṣṭvācapāvayet ārā
dhitāprayatnenasarvakāmaphalapradāḥ catvarṇāmapivarṇānāmāśramāṇāṃviśeṣataḥ strīṇāṃca puruṣāṇāṃ capūjyateṣṭaṃda

<pṛ0 7ba> dātihi pradakṣiṇaṃtubhūyiṣṭanamaskurvaṃtinityaśaḥ nateṣāṃduṣkṛtiṃkiṃcidakṣīṇamihadṛśyate ananyadarśanāprā
taḥyepaśyaṃtitapodhana nateṣāṃnarakekleśaḥprayāṃtiparamaṃpadaṃ vidheyamavidheyaṃvānyūnamapyathavādhikaṃ tu
lasīdalamādāyarāmaṃdhyātvāsamarpayet rāmāyanamityevaacyutāyanamastutaḥ anaṃtāyanamastasmātpraṇa(-)
vādivadedidaṃ sakṛtaṃsaphalāmetitulasīsannidhaumune (42) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃṣaṣṭodhyāyaḥ] (6)
sutīkṣṇuvāca agastyavadamesarvaṃrāmasyamunisattama maṃtrarājasyamāhātmyaṃyaduktaṃvrahmaṇāpurā agastyuvāca
sarvaṃtavābhidāsyāmipurāreḥpurataḥpurā vrahmāyadavravīttattvaṃśṛṇuṣvāvahitomama astivārāṇasīnāmapurīśivamano
harā sarvadāpiśivastatrapārvatyāsahatiṣṭati tasyāsyupāsakāḥsarvebhaktyātaṃpratipedire mumukṣavaḥparityajyasarvaṃ
tatraivasaṃsthitā sadāśivaśivatyevavadaṃtaḥśivatatparāḥ śivārpitamanaḥkāyāvācāśivaparāyaṇāḥ śivastā
namuhuḥpaśyanāsteciṃtāsamākulaḥ kathamebhyaḥpradasyāmimuktimityatiduḥkhitaḥ śivārpitamanaḥkāyā tatraivā
stegaṇaissārddhamṛṣibhiścasurāsuraiḥ evaṃpūtaicabhūrlokamājagāmapitāmahaḥ tamīśvaronirīkṣyaivasaṃbhrameṇakarotva
yaṃ bahusaṃbhāvayāmāsayaddhitaṃtannivedayat tataḥsaprāhabhagavānīśvarastaṃpitāmahaṃ kuśalaṃnanutevrahmanci
rāyitvamihāgataḥ śrīmadāgamanena (..)lokapūjyopyupāsakaiḥ samārādhyehamāmuktiṃprārthayaṃtimumukṣavaḥ keno(-)

<pṛ0 8a> pāyenateṣāṃtatphalaṃdāsyāmitadvada īśvareṇaivamuktastudruhiṇāpivabhāṣaha astipāyogopanīyaḥ prādādyaṃmeraghūtta
maḥ tapaḥkṛtvācirāyāhaṃtaṃparaṃlavdhavānparaṃ tatonyomadabhijñātonāstipāyomaheśvaraḥ mahyamanugrahīdrāmonasaṃde
hostitatravai īśvaruvāca athakimmevadasyatvaṃmayiyadyanukaṃpase satenābhihitodadhyokvakadāyuktapityapi pu
ṇyatīrthecagaṃgāyāṃlolārkesūryaparvaṇi tasmaimaṃtravaraṃprādātmaṃtrarājaṃṣaḍakṣaraṃ niyataḥsopitatraivajagāmavṛṣabhadhva
jaḥ manvaṃtaraṃśataṃbhaktyādhyānahomārcanādibhiḥ tataḥprasannobhagavān śrīrāmaḥprāhaśaṃkaraṃ vṛṇīṣvayadabhīṣṭaṃte
devānāmapidurlabhaṃ tadevāhaṃpradasyāmimāciraṃvṛṣabhadhvajaṃ tatastamavravīdviṣṇumīśvarāparayāmudā darśanenaiva
tedhanyaḥ kṛtārthāsmimamepsitaṃ etemadīyāḥsarvepimāṃparaṃparyupāsate muktyarthaṃtatkuruṣvaiṣāṃtadevābhimataṃmama nā
taḥparataraṃkiṃcitprārthitaṃmamavidyate evaṃtadapitatraivatadānīṃtadupāsakāḥ sarvajyotirmayāsaṃtoviṣṇorevalayaṃ
gatāḥ tataḥpravocarāmastaṃpunariṣṭaṃyadāsite vrūhīśvarātrataṃdāsyeprārthanādurlabhaṃcayat ityuktaḥsapunarvavrehitakṛ
dbhaktavatsalaḥ sarvalokopakārāyasarveṣāmapidurlabhaṃ yesvatovānyatovāpiyatrakutrāpivāprabho prāṇānparityajaṃ
statramuktisteṣāṃphalaṃbhavet gaṃgāyāṃvātaṭevāpi yatrakutrāpivāpunaḥ mṛyaṃteyeprabhodeva muktirnāṃtovarāṃtaraṃ śrīrā
muvāca kṣetretratavadeveśayatrakutrāpivāmṛtā kṛmikīṭādayopyāśumuktāḥsaṃtunacānyathā tvattovāvrāhmaṇovā

<pṛ0 8ba> piyelabhetaṣaḍakṣaraṃ jīvaṃtomaṃtrasiddhāsyuḥyuktāmāṃprāpnuvaṃtyapi kṣetresminyorcayedbhaktyāmaṃtrenānenaśaṃkara ahaṃsanni(-)
hitastatrapāṣāṇapratimādiṣu mumūrṣodakṣiṇekarṇeyasyayasyāpivāsvayaṃ upadekṣyasimanmaṃtraṃsamuktobhavitāśiva
ityuktavaṃtideveśipunarapyāhaśaṃkaraḥ mahātmamābhimānotrakṣetretrailokyadurlabhe phalaṃbhavatudeveśasarveṣāṃmuktila
kṣaṇaṃ mumūrṣūnāṃcasarveṣāṃdāsyemaṃtravaraṃparaṃ ityevamititatoviṣṇustasmaidatvāvarāṃtaraṃ yadabhīṣṭaṃpurastasyatatraivāṃtaradhī
yata tadāditadabhūnmuktiḥkṣetraṃtrailokyapāvanaṃ tatratiṣṭaṃtiyebhaktyāyāvajjivaniyamyate muktibhājobhavatyevasatyaṃsatyaṃ
nasaṃśayaḥ (33) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃsaptamodhyāyaḥ] (7) || sutīkṣṇuvāca kathaṃmaṃtravarabhūmaukena
cādaupratiṣṭitaṃ upādhideśakaḥkasmaitanmevrūhitapodhana agastyuvāca vrahmādadauvasiṣṭāyasvasutāyamanuṃtataḥ
savedavyāsamunayedadāvitthaṃgurukramaḥ vedavyāsamukhenātramaṃtrobhūmauprakāśitaḥ vedavyāsomahātejāḥśiṣyebhyaḥ
samupāviśat guruśiṣyaguṇānādauśaunakāyavravīnmuniḥ saśaunakenapṛṣṭaḥsattāhamaṃtrāṃtarāṇica yaṃtrapūjārvidhi(-)
rhomatathātarpaṇalakṣaṇaṃ puraścaraṇasaṃkhyācahomadravyāṃtarāṇica tapaḥsthānānisiddhiṃcayaduktaṃvrahmaṇāpurā tattadu
ktaṃpravakṣyāmiyadiśrotumihechasi sutīkṣṇuvāca devatopāsakaḥśāṃtoviṣayeṣvapinispṛhaḥ adhyātmavitvrahma
vādīvedaśāstrārthakovidaḥuddhartuṃcaivasaṃhartuṃsamarthovrāhmaṇottamaḥ maṃtrajñoyaṃtramaṃtrāṇāṃyaṃtravettārahasyavit puraścara(-)

<pṛ0 9a> ṇasaṃkhyācahomadravyāṃtarāṇica tapaḥ sthānānisiddhiṃcayaduktaṃvrahmaṇāpurā tattaduktaṃpravakṣyāmiyadiśrotumihecha
si sutīkṣṇuvāca devatopāsakaḥśāṃtoviṣayeṣvapinispṛhaḥ adhyātmavitvrahmavādī vedaśāstrārthakovidaḥ
uddhartuṃcaivasaṃhartuṃ samarthovrāhmaṇottamaḥ maṃtrajñoyaṃtramaṃtrāṇāṃyaṃtravettārahasyavit puraścaraṇakṛti(...)maṃtrasiddhoprayo
gavit tapasvīsatyavādīcagṛhasthogururucyate āstikogurubhaktaścajijñāsuḥśraddhayāsaha kāmakrodhādiduḥkhotthavai
rāgyovanitādiṣu sarvātmanātitīrṣuścabhavāvdebhavaduḥkhavit vrāhmaṇodharmamokṣārthakāmārthavigataspṛhaḥ kiṃvā
dharmārthamokṣārthaniṣkāmaścāthavādvijaḥ manovākkāyadharmaistunityaṃśuśūṣikogurauḥ suvarṇāśramadharmoktakarmaniṣṭaḥ
sadāśuciḥ śucivratatamāḥśūdrāḥdhārmikāḥ dvijasevakāḥ striyaḥpativratāścānyepratilomānulomajāḥ lokāścāṃ
ḍālaparyaṃtāḥsarvapyatrādhikāriṇaḥ svajātidharmmaniratāḥbhaktāḥsarveśvarasyaye upadeśaḥsamasteṣāṃtattajjātyanusārataḥ
alasāmalinākliṣṭāḥdāṃbhikāḥkṛpaṇāstathā daridrādrogiṇotkṛṣṭārogiṇobhogalālasāḥ asūyāmatsaragrastāḥ
śaṭāḥ paruṣavādinaḥ anyāyopārjitadhanāḥparadāraratāścaye viduṣāṃvairiṇaścaivahyajñāpaṃḍitamāninaḥ bhraṣṭavratā(-)
ścayekaṣṭavṛttayaḥpiśunākhalā vahvāśinaḥkrūraceṣṭāḥkrūrātmānaścaniṃditāḥ ityevamādayopyanyepāpiṣṭāpuruṣādhamāḥ
nateṣāṃnarakleśānistāromunisattama kṣuddhāḥpralobhinastaiteniṃditebhyodiśaṃtiye vinaśyatyevatatsarvaṃsaikateśā(-)

<pṛ0 9ba> libījavat yaiḥ śiṣyaiḥśiśvadāvāttuguravo'vamānitāḥ putramitrakalatrādisaṃpadbhyaḥpracyutāhite akṛtebhyo
nivāryaścaguruśikṣāsahiṣṇavaḥ evaṃbhūtāḥ parityājyāḥ śikhyatvenopakalpitāḥ yaditepyupakalperandevatākro
śakājanāḥ bhavaṃtīhadaridrāsteputradāravivarjitāḥ narakāścaivadehāstetiryakṣuḥprabhavaṃtiye yegurvavajñāṃkurvaṃ(-)
tipāpiṣṭāḥpuruṣādhamāḥ adhikṣipyaguruṃmohātparuṣaṃpravadaṃtiye śūkaratvaṃbhavatyevateṣāṃjanmaśatodbhavaṃ yeguru'
drohiṇomūḍhāḥsatataṃpāpakāriṇaḥ teṣāṃcaryāvatsukṛtaṃtadbhasmasyānnasaṃśayaḥ tārādimuktayelakṣmīvījādi
muktayettathā vāksiddhayecavāgvījaṃpraṇavāṃtevinikṣipet mānmathaṃsarvavaśyāyayadetattritayaṃpunaḥ tārāṃtecaivarā
mādau sarvārthaṃviniyojayet rāmāyanamityeṣamaṃtraḥpaṃcākṣaraḥsmṛtaḥ rāmityekākṣaromaṃtrorāmityaparomanuḥ caṃdrāṃ
taścaivabhadrāṃtaḥpunarvedāvibhajyate paṃcāśanmātṛkāvarṇaḥ pratyekaṃrāmapūrvakaḥ lakṣmīvānmathādiścasarvatrapraṇa(-)
vādikāḥ rāmaścacaṃdrabhadrāṃtaścaturthyaṃtīhṛdāsaha bahudhābhidyatetārasahitoyaṃṣaḍakṣaraḥ ekadhācadvidhātredhācaturdhā
paṃcadhātathā ṣaṭsaptadhā'ṣṭadhācaivabahudhāyaṃvyavasthitaḥ maṃtroyadupadeṣṭaṣovrāhmaṇādyanurūpataḥ saṃpūjyavidhiva
ttatrasaṃsthāpyakalaśaṃnavaṃ tatsāmarthyānurūpeṇamṛtsuvarṇamayastathā dātrāpradīyateyadvanmaṃtrodeyastathāmune (35) 
[ityagastisaṃhitāyāṃaṣṭamodhyāyaḥ] || (8) || sutīkṣṇuvāca || kiṃtadyaṃtraṃvadavrahmansvayaṃtasyacacānaca

<pṛ0 10a> kairmaṃtrairvākathaṃkutralekhyaṃkiṃtenavābhavet agastyuvāca manorathakarānyatraniryyaaṃtetapodhana kāmakrodhādido(-)
ṣotthadīrghayaṃtraniyaṃtraṇān yaṃtramityāhuretasminrāmaḥprīṇātipūjanāt yaṃtramaṃtramayaṃprāhurdevatāmaṃtrarūpiṇī
yaṃtrāhapūjitorāmaḥ sahasānaprasīdati śrīrāmaḥpūjitoyaṃtre sītayāsahayaṃtritaḥ yadiṣṭaṃtatkarotyevatattanmaṃ
travarādṛte śarīramivajīvasyarāmasyamanurucyate yaṃtramaṃtraṃsamārādhyayadabhīṣṭaṃtadāpnuyāt yaṃtremaṃtraṃsamārādhya
prasādayatirāghavaṃ sarveṣāmapimaṃtrāṇāṃyaṃtrepūjāvidhīyate yaṃtrasvarūpaṃvakṣyāmiyathoktaṃvrahmaṇāpurā ādauṣaṭ(-)
koṇamuddhṛtyatatovṛttaṃlikhenmune dalānivilikhedaṣṭautataḥsyāccaturasrakaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannaṃvyaktaṃsarvamano
haraṃ tadaṃtarepisuvyaktaṃsādhyākhyākarmagarbhitaṃ tadvījaṃvilikhedbhūyastakroḍīkṛtmānmathaṃ tatastatpaṃcavījāni
punarāvartayenmune punardaśākṣareṇaivatadevapariveṣṭayet ṣaḍaṃgānyagnikoṇādikoṇeṣvevalikhetkramāt ta
thārkoṇakapāleṣuhrīṃśrīṃcavilikhenmune hūṃvījaṃpratikoṇāgrakeśarāgneṣucasvarān mālāmaṃtrasyavarṇāsya
catvāriṃśaccasaptaca varṇāḥsaptadaleṣvevaṣaṭṣaṭpaṃcādamedale pūrvatoveṣṭayetkādyaistatsarvaṃcatapodhana vīja
dvayaṃcavilikhennarasiṃhavarāhayo digvidikṣvapipūrvasmātbhūgṛhecaturasrake yaṃtresminsamyagārādhyabhuktiṃmu
ktiṃca viṃdati yadvāmadhyelikhettāraṃṣaṭkoṇeṣvapicakramāt mūlamaṃtrākṣareṇaivasaṃdhirṣvagaṃcamānmathaṃ māyāgaṃḍeṣu

<pṛ0 10ba> kiṃjalkaisvarāṇāṃlekhanaṃbhavet yaṃtreṣupūrvavanmālāmaṃtrollekhyaḥprameṇahi daśākṣareṇasaṃveṣṭyakādīnivyaṃjanāni
ca digvidikṣulikhedvījaṃnarasiṃhavarāhayoḥ etadyaṃtrātaraṃyatrasāṃgāvaraṇamarcayet sauvaṇairājatebhūrjelikhitvā
rcanamārabhet hūṃjānakīvallabhāyasvāhākṣauṃhūṃvinirdiśet daśākṣarovarāhasyanṛsiṃhasyamanusmṛtaḥ hrīṃśrīṃklīṃoṃ
vrūyānnamobhagavatepadaṃ raghunaṃdanāyetipadaṃrakṣoghnaviśadāyaca madhuretiprasannetivadanāyetipadaṃvadet viśeṣaṇaṃpaṃ
camaṃcavrūyādamitatejase tatobalāyarāmāyaviṣṇavenamityatha mahāmaṃtroyamuddiṣṭonṛṇāṃciṃtāmaṇiḥsmṛtaḥ
oṃhrīṃśrīṃsītāyaivahnijāyāsītāmaṃtrudārhṛtaḥ yaṃtresminnāmamārādhyasāṃgāvaraṇamādarāt ārādhyaguṭakīkṛtya
dhārayedyaṃtramanvahaṃ dāridryaduḥkhaśamanaṃputrapautrapravarddhanaṃ aiśvaryakṛdvaśyakaraṃśatrusaṃhārakārakaṃ vidyāpradaṃsaukhyakaraṃ
rogaśokanivāraṇaṃ parābhicārakṛtyeṣuvajrapaṃjarucyate kimatrabahunoktenasarvasiddhipradaṃmune (27) ||    || 
[itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃnavamodhyāyaḥ] (9) || agastyuvāca || pūjāvidhānaṃvakṣyāmināradābhihitaṃcayat
vālmīkayemunīṃdrāyadvārapūjādikaṃyathā ākarṇayamuniśreṣṭasarvābhīṣṭaphalapradaṃ śrīrāmadvārapālāṃgaparivāra
tayāsthitāḥ yesurāstānihastaumitanmūlāsiddhayoyataḥ vaṃdegaṇapatiṃbhānutilakasvāminaṃśivaṃ kṣetrapālaṃcadhātā

<pṛ0 11a> raṃvidhātāramanaṃtara gṛhādhīśaṃgṛhaṃgaṃgāṃyamunāṃkuladevatāṃ caṃḍapracaṃḍaucatathāśaṃkhapadmanidhīapi vāstoṣpatiṃdvā
ralakṣmīṃguruṃvāgadhidevatāṃ etāḥsaṃpūjyabhaktyāhaṃśrīrāmadvāradevatāḥ mahāmaṃḍūkakālāgnirudrābhyāṃpraṇamāmyahaṃ
ādhāraśaktikūrmābhyāṃnāgādhipatayetathā pṛthivyaicatathākṣīrasāgarāyanamonamaḥ śvetadvīpāyaratnādraukalpa
vṛkṣāyatenamaḥ suvarṇamaṃḍapāyāthapuṣpakāyamahārhatau vimānāṣṭakaratnāyasamyaksiṃhāsanāyaca udyadādi
tyasaṃśobhipadmāyatadanaṃtaraṃ namāmidharmajñānābhyāṃvairāgyāyāgnitaḥkramāt aiśvaryāyatatodharmājñānābhyāṃpū
rvataḥkramāt avairāgyāyacatathānaiśvaryāyanamonamaḥ amarkamaṃḍalāyāthuparyyuparisarvadā oṃcaṃdramaṃḍalāye
tidhyātvādhyātvānamāmyahaṃ mamagnimaṃḍalāyetisaṃpūjyaivaṃprayatnataḥ sattvāyarajasenityaṃtamasepinamonamaḥ
ātmāṃtarātmaparamātmajñānātmanetathā praṇavādi(.) (...)tenayajenmadhyeviśudhyati vimalotkarṣinījñānākri
yāyogābhyityapi namāmiprahvīṃsatyāmīśānāyaidalāṃtare purvāditonugrahāyaipraṇamāmitadaṃtare namobhagava
tetadvadviṣṇavetadanaṃtaraṃ sarvabhūtātmanecetivāsudevāyityapi tataḥsarvātmasaṃyogapadmapīṭhātmanenamaḥ ya
jāmaheyuvāmoṃhrīmātmanāsaṃvyavasthitau namoṃtāyacarāmāyasasītāyanamonamaḥ sānnidhyādhārayogenaniya

<pṛ0 11ba> tenaṣaḍānanā vyavasthitāyarāmāyanamopyaṃtāyavahnaye śrīvījādyapisītāyaisvāhāṃtoyaṃṣaḍakṣaraḥ tadetanmaṃtra
rūpāyarāmāyajyotiṣenamaḥ sāmusvārasvarāṃtāyavahnayehṛdayāyaca namaścaiveśvarāṃtāyasvarāṃtāyakṛṣānave śi
rasepyagnayecoṃtaḥ śikhāyaivaṣaḍātmane evaṃnamaḥṣaḍaṃgātmarāmāyajyotiṣenamaḥ ātmāṃtarātmaparamajñānātmabhyo
gnitaḥkramāt nivṛtyaivapratiṣṭāyaividyāyaitenamāmyahaṃ śāṃtyaicātmādiśaktitvesthitaitadrūpiṇonamaḥ vāsudevāya
tenityaṃtathāsaṃkarṣaṇāyaca pradyumnāyāniruddhāyaśriyaiśāṃtyainamonamaḥ prītyairetyainamorāmadvitīyāvaraṇātma
ne agrehanūmānasugrīvobharataścavibhīṣaṇaḥ lakṣmaṇāścāgadaścaivaśatrughnaujāṃbavāṃstathā dhṛṣṭirjayaṃtivijayaḥsu
rāṣṭrorāṣṭravarddhanaḥ akopodharmapālaścasumaṃtraścāṣṭamaṃtriṇaḥ etebhyorāmarūpebhyoyuṣmabhyaṃpraṇamāmyahaṃ iṃdrādiyama
devebhyaḥ sāyudhebhyonamonamaḥ vāyavedanadāyātharudrādyaśāyatenamaḥ vrahmaṇenaṃtarūpāyadikpālāyātmanenamaḥ
tadāyudhāyavajrāyaśaktayedaṃḍakāyaca namaḥkhaḍgāyapāśāyadhvajāyacagadātmane triśūlāyāṃvujāyāthacakrāyasata
taṃnamaḥ vasiṣṭovāmadevaścajāvālirgautamastathā bharadvājakauśikaścavālmīkirnāradastathā etebhyorāmarū
pebhyoyuṣmabhyaṃpraṇamāmyahaṃ nalaṃnīlaṃcagavayaṃgavākṣaṃgaṃdhamādanaṃ svarabhiścāpimeṃdaṃbadvividhaṃcayajetkramā
t śaṃkhacakragadāpadmaśārṅgabāṇāyudhātmane garunmatenamastubhyaṃviśvaksenādikāścaye sarvaiśvaryasvarūpāya

<pṛ0 12a> jyotiṣesatataṃnamaḥ manovākvāyajanitaṃkarmayadvāśubhāśubhaṃ tatsarvaṃprītayebhūyānnamorāmāyaśārṅgiṇe etadrahasyaṃsatataṃ
pratyūṣasisamāhitaḥ yaḥpaṭhedrāmamāhātmyaṃvidyaiśvaryyanidhirbhavet vināśayedasaubhāgyaṃdāridraughaṃnikṛṃtayet u
padravāṃścaśamayetsarvalokaṃvaśaṃnayet yaḥpaṭetprātarutthāyavrahmārpaṇadhiyānvahaṃ sayātiśāśvataṃvrahmapunarāvṛtti
durlabhaṃ nāradīyamidaṃstotraṃsutīkṣṇamunisattama paṭhitavyaṃprayatnenarāmārcanaparāyaṇaiḥ gaṇapatyādayaiḥsarvaidvārāṃga
vṛttirūpiṇaḥ praṇavādinamoṃtenaṃcaturthyāsvasvanāmabhiḥ upacāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhistathaikādaśabhirmune paṃcabhirvāprayatne
nasvasvaśaktyanusārataḥ gaṇapatyādayohyetepūjitāpūjayaṃtyapi (44) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃdaśamodhyā
yaḥ] || 10 || agastyuvāca śarīraṃśodhayedādāvadhikāryyārthamanvahaṃ tīrthāvagāhanaṃvāhyepyaṃtarbhūtaviśodhanaṃ
mātṛkonyāsayogaścaśodhayedvidhyanukṣitaḥ pūjādravyāṇicatataḥśodhayetprokṣaṇādibhiḥ pūjāpātrāṇiśaṃkhaṃcaśodha
yetkṣālanādibhiḥ śuddhaścaśuddhadravyaiścapūjayetpuruṣottamaṃ evamārādhitodevaḥsamyagārādhitobhavet nacennirarthakaṃsa
rvaṃsiṃdhusaikatavṛṣṭivat śaucācamanavihīnasyasnānasaṃdhyādikāḥkriyāḥ niḥphalaṃsyuryyadācaitadaṃtareṇabhavettathā
saṃśodhyapūjādravyāṇisvasyāpibahiraṃtaraṃ śaṃkhaṃcapūjayetsarvaṃpūjyaṃpūjyārhatāṃvrajet pūjakasyāthapūjāsyātpāvana
syakṛtaṃtathā apāvanānyapūjanānisādhanānivarjayet ataḥsnātvāprakurvītabhūtaśuddhividhāyaca vinyasyamātṛ

<pṛ0 12ba> kāpūrvaṃvaiṣṇavīṃvidhivanmune vidhāyatattvanyāsaṃtanmūrtipaṃjaraṃtathā tadṛṣichaṃdasonyāsastathātanmaṃtradaivataṃ vinya
syaivaṃṣaḍaṃgānitattadvījākṣarāṇica atothādevatādhyānaṃtataḥpūjanamaṃtataḥ tatonivedyatatsarvaṃjapenmaṃtramananya
dhīḥ tatovijñāpyadeveśaṃparivārāṃścapūjayet evaṃsaṃpūjitodevaḥsarvānkāmānprayachati bāhyapūjāṃtataḥkuryyāddau
hikābhyudayāyavaiḥ vilikhyavedikāsamyaṃmaṃḍalaṃtatrakārayet śālitaṃḍulacūrṇaiścanīlapītaiḥsitāsitaiḥ likheda(-)
ṣṭadalaṃpadmaṃcaturasraṃsamāvṛtaṃ ṣaṭkoṇakarṇikāmadhyekoṇāgrevṛttamuttamaṃ sādhyamevatataḥśobhārekhābhirupaśobhitaṃ
saṃpūjyamaṃḍalaṃcaivatatrasiṃhāsanaṃnyaset caṃdrātapapatākaiścatoraṇairapisarvataḥ vicitraṃtatratatrāpibhittistaṃbhagṛhādiṣu
evaṃsaṃśobhitasthānesarvamaṃgalasaṃvṛte puṇyastrībhirgṛhasthaiścaparitovyavahartṛbhiḥ gāyadbhirapinṛtyadbhirvadadbhiḥ
stutipūrvakaṃ bherīmṛdaṃgaṃvaṃśādikāṃspatālādibhirbahuḥ vādayadbhiścabahudhāsamyagārādhitoyadi raghunāthaḥsvayaṃ
tatraprasannobhagavānbhavet saṃpādyavividhaiḥpuṣpaiḥpūrayetpuṣpajālikā tulasīpadmajātpādyairmālyairvahuvidhairapi svapu
rodakṣiṇetīrtheśuddhavārisupūritaṃ kaluṣaṃsvapurodhāyabhogeṣuviniyojayet anyānipūjādravyāṇipurastādevaniḥ
kṣipet ārādhanāyadevasyavedikādhaḥsukhāsane kuśāstaraṇavaiyāghracarmavāsovinirmite upaviśyaśucirbhogī
bhūtvāpūjāṃsamācaret tathāmalakamālāṃcasamyakpuṣkaramālikāṃ nirmālyatulasīmālāṃśirasyapinidhāyavai nirmā

<pṛ0 13a> lyacaṃdanenāṃgamaṃkayettasyanāmabhiḥ tasyāyudhānibāhvoścatenaivadvijasattama pāpiṣṭocāpyapāpiṣṭaḥsarvajñopyajña
evavā bhavedevādhikāryatrapūjākarmmaṇyasaṃśayaḥ padmaṃsvastikabhadrādirūpeṇākuṇṭhyapadvayaṃ vināyakaṃnamaskṛtya
savyāṃśecasarasvatīṃ dakṣiṇāṃśepūrvavaccadurgāṃcakṣetrapaṃpunaḥ omastrāyaphaṭproktābhrāmayeddakṣiṇaṃkaraṃ tatastuciṃtayedaṃ
tardevaṃsthānatrayāṃtare jyotirmayamanasyaṃtaṃsatyajñānasukhātmakaṃ ātmanaḥparitovahniprākāratrāṇanāyaca bhūtapretapi
śābhyāṃvidhāyatadanaṃtaraṃ adbhiḥpuṣpākṣataiścaivavahnibījāstramaṃtritaiḥ prallipetparitomaṃtrībhayavighnanivṛttaye hṛdaṃ
vujevrahmakaṃdasaṃbhūtejñānanālake ārāgramātrojīvastuciṃtanīyomanīṣibhiḥ netavyohaṃsamaṃtreṇadvādaśāṃtesthitaḥ
paraḥ tenasaṃyojyavidhivadbhūtaśuddhimathācaret bhūtānināmapṛthivījalaṃtejoviyanmarut yadyatojāyatetasmi
npralayotpāda naṃpunaḥ jīvanapunarātmānaṃciṃtayetpuruṣāptaye jīvasyatanusiddhyai śarīrākārabhūtānāṃbhūtānāṃ
śodhanaṃpunaḥ marudagnisudhāvījaiḥpaṃcāśanmātṛmātṛkā prāṇānnirudhyātmadehaṃśoṣayettatpunardahet taddehaṃpu
narāplāvyapunarjīvamihānayet jīvenapunarātmānaṃciṃtayetpuruṣāptaye jīvasyatanusiddhyaicatasyāpyātmatvasiddhaye
nayanānayanārthaṃcahaṃsaḥsohamitīrayet bhūtaśuddhirayaṃnāmakartavyānāmasārthakṛt bhūtaśuddhiṃvināyasyajapahomādi
kāḥkriyāḥ bhavaṃtiniḥphalāḥsarvāḥprakāreṇapratiṣṭitāḥ gṛhopasarpaṇaṃcaivatathānugamanaṃhareḥ bhaktyāpradakṣiṇaṃcaivapā

<pṛ0 13ba> dayoḥśodhanaṃviduḥ pūjārthaṃyaṃtrapuṣpāṇāṃbhaktyaivottolanaṃhareḥ karayoḥsarvaśuddhīnāmiyaṃśuddhirudāhṛtā yannāmakī
rtanaṃcaivaguṇānamapikīrtanaṃ bhaktyāśrīrāmacaṃdrasyavacasaḥśuddhiriṣyate tatkathāśravaṇaṃcaivatasyotsavanirīkṣaṇaṃ
śrotrayornetrayoścaivavuddhisamyagihācyate pādodakasyanirmālyaṃmālānāmapidhāraṇaṃ ucyateśirasaḥśuddhiḥpraṇata
syaharepunaḥ āghrāṇaṃgaṃdhapuṣpāderarcitasyatapodhana viśuddhiḥsyādanaṃtasyaghrāṇasyevāvidhīyate patrapuṣpādikaṃ
yadyadrāmapādayugārpitaṃ viśuddhayebhavatyevasvātmanādhāryyateyadi adhunāpyathavāpūrvaṃyadyadviṣṇusamarpitam
tadevapāṭanaṃloketaddhisarvaṃviśodhayet || (47) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāmekādaśodhyāyaḥ] (11)
agastyuvāca athātomātṛkānyāsakramotrāparipaṭhyate niyamyāsūnṛṣichaṃdodevatābījayoṣitaḥ śirovada
nahṛdguhyapādeṣunyāsucyate karāṃgulīnāṃrekhāsusvarekaikaṃpravinyaset vinyasetpraṇavaṃpāṇiḥtalayoḥpṛṣṭayo
rapi hrasvaṃdīrghasvarāṃtāyāṣkādayaḥpaṃcapaṃcakāḥ amaścādyaṃtayoryyādilāṃtaścadaśavarṇakaḥ aṃguṣṭādyaṃgulīnāṃcata
thaivatalapṛṣṭayoḥ nyāsastutaḥṣaḍaṃgānāṃbhavatyevaṃprakalpanā hṛdimūrdhniśikhāyāṃcasarvāṃgenetrayorapi dikṣustraṃca
namaḥsvāhāvaṣaṭhūṃvauṣaḍapyatha tathāstrāyāphaṭityevaṣaḍaṃgānāṃcapallavaṃ tatrasthānecaturthyaṃtetattatpallavayo
gataḥ tattadaṃgagatonyāsastattatsthāneṣuyujyate athāṃtarmātṛkānyāsaḥkaṃṭhahṛnnābhiguhyake pāyaubhrūmadhyakepadmeṣoḍa

<pṛ0 14a> śadvādaśachade daśapatrecaṣaṭpatrecatuṣpatredvipatrake paṃcāśadvarṇavinyāsaḥ patrasaṃsthākramādbhavetekaikavarṇamekaika
patrāṃtevinyasenmune evamaṃtaḥpravinyasyamanasātovahirnyaset śirovadanavṛttecacakṣuḥśrotraṣugetathā nāsākapo(-)
layugaletathoṣṭādharayorapi ūrdhvāṃdhodaṃtapaṃktyoścamūrddhāsyeṣoḍaśasvarān kacavargadvayaṃvāhvoḥpaṃcasaṃdhitalenyaset
ṭatavargadvayaṃpādasaṃdhyagrepitathānyaset pavargaṃpārśvayugalapṛṣṭanābhyudareṣuca hṛdomūlakakutkukṣihṛdādikarapadva
ye jaṭharānanayoścaivavyāpakaṃviniyojayet paṃcāśadakṣaraṃnyāsaḥkrameṇaivavidhīyate omādyaṃtonamoṃtosaviṃduṃbiṃduṃvi
varjitaḥ māyālakṣmīkāmavījapūrvonyastavyucyate keśavāyacakīrtyaicatathānārāyaṇāyaca kāṃtyaitathāmādhavāya
tuṣṭyainamitinyaset goviṃdāyacapuṣṭyaicaviṣṇurdhṛtyairvadettataḥ madhusūdanāyaśāṃtyaitrivikramāyakriyāyai vāmanāya
dayāyaicaśrīdharāyavadettathā medhāyaihṛṣīkeśāyaharṣāyaicanamattathā padmanābhāyaśraddhāyaitathādarāyaca lajjāyaina
mityuktaṃvāsudevāyacaivahi lakṣmyainamityuktāsaṃkaṣaṇāyavadettataḥ sarasvatyaipradyumnāyaratyaiprītyaiitīrayet ani
ruddhāyaratyaicakharāṃtepravadedatha cakriṇevijayāyaicaśārṅgiṇegadinetathā durgāyaicaprabhāyaicakhaḍginevinyasedatha sa
tyāyaiśaṃkhinecaivacaṃḍāyaicanamastathā halinecatathāvāṇyainamomuśalinevadet vilāsinyaiśūlinecavijayāyaitadanaṃ(-)
taraṃ pāśinevirajāyaicatathācāṃkuśinevadet viśvāyaicamukuṃdāyavinadāyainamastathā naṃdajāyasunaṃdāyainaṃdinesmṛtayena

<pṛ0 14ba> maḥ narāyṛddhyaitadvatnarakaghnetathāvadet samṛddhyaiharayeśuddhyaikṛṣṇāyacabhuktetathā satvāyavuddhyasātvatāyamatyainama
itīrayet śaurayecakṣamāyaicaśūrāyacaramāyainamaḥ janārdanāyacomāyaitataḥśārṅgadharāyaca kledinyaiviśvamūrtayekli(-)
nnāyaitadanaṃtaraṃ vaikuṃṭhāyanamastadvadvasudāyainamastathā puruṣottamāyavasudhāyaiparāyaivalinetathā bālānujāyaparā(-)
yaṇāyainamitīrayet valāyavadasūkṣmāyaisaṃdhyāyaicavṛṣaghnate vṛṣāyacaprajñāyaihaṃsāyaiprabhāyaitathā vārāhāyainiśāyai
cavimalāyavadettataḥ amoghāyainamastadvannarasiṃhāyavidyute krameṇakāmavījaṃcamātṛkākṣarevaca ekaṃdaivaṃtathā
śaktirekannamitikramaḥ keśavaṃcāpikīrtiṃcanamoṃtevinyasetpunaḥ śirovadanavṛttādisthāneṣvevaṃvidhiḥsmṛtaḥ oṃkā
ramāravījaṃcamātṛkākṣarevaca ekaṃdaivaṃtathāśaktirekaṃnamitikramaḥ keśavādirayaṃnyāsonyāsamātreṇadehināṃ 
acyutattvaṃdadātyevasatyaṃsatyaṃnasaṃśayaḥ sutīkṣṇatattvaṃvakṣyāmitathānyāsamataḥśṛṇu yattatvanyāsamātreṇatattvameva
prajāyate pādayaḥpratilomenakātāḥsyuḥsarvasaṃjñakāḥ namaḥparāyapūrvetupraṇavāṃtevyavasthitāḥjīvaḥprāṇaścavuddhi
ścapyahaṃkāronamastathā sarvāṃgehṛdivinyasyaśrotrādīniṃdriyāṇyapi mūrdhniprāṇecahṛdayepyupasthepādayorapi
śrotratvakcakṣuṣījihvāghrāṇarūpādidehināṃ jñāneṃdriyāpipaṃcāpitattatsthānenyasetpunaḥ vākpāṇipādapāyūcaka
ramukhyānihyupasthake tathaivatattatsthāneṣutattadevapravinyaset śiromukhecahṛdayetathāguhyepipādayoḥ ākāśā(-)

<pṛ0 15a> nilatejāṃsisalilaṃpṛthivīṃtathā vinyasetpūrvavaccaivanyāsavadbhirudīritaṃ śāhosairāmakhāvāpiyaścarājabalāpi
kṣauṃcetidaśavarṇāṃcapraṇavāṃtecapūrvavat hṛtpadmasomasūryāgnisvakalāyukkamaṃḍale trayaṃhṛdyevavinyasyavāsudevāda
yastathā parameṣṭīcapuruṣoviśvasyāpinivṛttikāḥ nārāyaṇonṛsiṃhaścasarvakopāsyapūrvakau mūrdhnyāsyehṛdiguhye
capādayorvyāpakaṃtataḥ tadātmanenamititatrasthānenyaseccatat atastasyāpyapūjyasyatatprāpterhetunātataḥ
tvayānyāsamitiprāhurnyāsastatvavidojanāḥ yaḥkuryyāttattvadanyāsaṃsevabhavatidhruvaṃ tadātmanānupraviśyabhagavāni
hatiṣṭati yataḥsevasattvānisarvaṃtasminpratiṣṭitaṃ tanmūrtipaṃjaraṃnyāsastasyatanmūrtisiddhaye ākarṇayaikacittaḥ
sanyatostinaphalāṃtaraṃ namobhagavatevrūyādvāsudevāyityapi omādevasyamaṃtrasyādāyaikākṣaraṃtataḥ ekaikamakṣaraṃ
tadvacchrīrāmākhyamanorapi dvirāvṛtyākṣarādānaṃviṣṇordaśasunāmasu nāmaikaikamupādāyasūryasyāpicanāmasu oṃtataḥ
svarastadvadvāsudevākṣaraṃtataḥ śrīrāmamaṃtravarṇaścatataḥsyuḥkeśavādayaḥ dhātrādayonamoṃtāyasūryasyāpicanāmasunya(-)
stavyonyāsayogataḥ lalāṭanābhihṛdayaṃkaṃṭhapārśvāsakaṃdhare pārśvotarāṃseskaṃdhecapṛṣṭekakudicakramāt keśavaṃcatato
vrūyānnārāyaṇitisvayaṃ mādhavaścaivagoviṃdoviṣṇuścamadhusūdanaḥ trivikramovāmanaścaśrīdharonavamaḥsmṛtaḥ hṛṣī
keśaḥpadmanābhaḥtathādāmodaraḥprabhuḥ viṣṇordvādaśanāmānicemānimunisattama dhātāryyamācamitraścavaruṇāṃśobhaga

<pṛ0 15ba> stathā vivasvāniṃdrapūṣācaparjanyodaśamaḥsmṛtaḥ tvaṣṭācaviṣṇuretānināmānidvādaśātmanaḥ tanmūrtipaṃjarannyāsobhi
hitaḥparameṣṭinā śirobhrūmadhyahṛdayenābhiguhyapadastane mūlamaṃtrākṣarānyāsaṃṣaḍaṃgamapivinyaset evaṃvinnyasya
vidhivatsākṣānnārāyaṇobhavet jvararogābhicārādyāḥpralayaṃyāṃtinānyathā bhūtapretapiśācāścatathaivavrahmarākṣasāḥ
kūṣmāṃḍāścaivaḍākinyonaivadraṣṭamapikṣaraṃ yevaṃvinyaseddhīmānrāmaḥsākṣātsvayaṃbhavet nātaḥparataraṃkiṃcitpāvanaṃpuṇya
mastihi || (65) [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃdvādaśodhyāyaḥ] || (12) || agastyuvāca sutīkṣṇapātrāṇyāsādya
tataḥpūjārthamādarāt śaṃkhamastreṇasaṃśodhyasadādhārenidhāyaca pūjayedagnisūryeduṃvījaistattvaphalānvitaiḥ tattatkalā
nāṃsaṃkhyābhirdaśadvādaśaṣoḍaśaḥ ādhāraśaṃkhatīrtheṣutattadātmānamarcayet tīrthāvāhanamaṃtraiścatīrthānyābāhyapūja
yet gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatairdhūpairdīpādyairapibhaktitaḥ śaṃkhamudrāṃcamudrāṃcagāruḍākhyāṃpradarśayet paramīkṛtyayatnetapāvanaṃta
dviciṃtayet devasyamūrdhnitatsiṃcetpūjādravyeṣucātmanaḥ avekṣaṇaṃprokṣaṇaṃcavīkṣaṇaṃtāḍanaṃtathā arcanaṃcaivasarveṣāṃpā
vanatvaṃprakalpayet pūtamevākhilaṃpūjāyogyaṃbhavatisādhanaṃ arghapātrepradānārthaṃmadhuparkārthamapyatha tathaivācamanārthaṃca
nyasetpātracatuṣṭayaṃ ātmanaḥpurataḥśaṃkhaṃpūrvataḥsādhayettataḥ arghapātrepādyapātresaṃpūjyasalilaṃśubhaṃ tatrārghapātredā(-)
tavyāḥgaṃdhapuṣpākṣatāyavāḥ kuśāgratilapūrvāścasarṣapāścārthasiddhaye pādyapātrepidātavyaṃśyāmākaṃdūrvamevaca abjaṃcavi

<pṛ0 16a> ṣṇukrāṃtāṃcapādyasiddhyaiprayojayet tathācamanamātrepidadyājjātīphalaṃmune lavaṃgamapikakkolaṃśastamācamanī
yakaṃ dadhnācamadhusarpibhyāṃmadhuparkkobhaviṣyati snānapuruṣasūktenaśuddhaśaṃkhodakenaca kṣīradadhyājyamadhubhiḥkhaṃ
ḍenacapṛthakpṛthak nālikerodakenāpitathātālaphalāṃvunā gaṃdhadravyaiścabahubhistathāgaṃdhodakenaca aikṣaveno
dakenāpisukarpūrādigaṃdhitā śataṃsahasramayutaṃśaktyāvāpyabhiṣecayet śaṃkhaṃsaṃpūryatenaivasupuṣpeṇaraghūttamam
sakṛṣṇāgurudhūpenadhūpayannaṃtarāṃtarā tataḥśuddhajalenaivasnāpayetamananyadhīḥ rājyārtherājyasiddhyarthaṃnityaṃvatsara(-)
mādarāt evamevabhiṣecyaivarājābhavatinānyathā dattvāpyācamanīyaṃcavāsasīparidhāpayet tatobhūṣaṇadānaṃca
sottarīyenavāsasā yajñopavītaṃdattvācadadyāccaṃdanamādarāt puṣpāṇigaṃdhamālyānivividhānisamarpayet dhūpaṃ
dīpaṃcanaivedyaṃtāṃvūlaṃcapradakṣiṇaṃ namaskāraṃcapūjāyāṃupacārāstuṣoḍaśa āvāhanādikāhyetetathaikādaśapaṃcaca 
bhavaṃtyaiḥvopacāraistaiḥpūjāṃkuryyādaharniśaṃ vādyairapicagaṃdhādyaiḥśaktyābhaktyāpakalpitaiḥ dvārapīṭhāmarāmādāvabhya
rcyaivaṃpurastataḥ rāmamārādhyavidhināsarvairapyupacārakaiḥ arcyāṃgāvaraṇādevāḥsaṃpūjyānyāyudhānica evaṃsamyaksa
mārādhyasāṃgāvaraṇavāhanaṃ stotavyamatiyatnenarāmasamyakpraṇamyaca yaṃtrasyāpimaṃtraiścasamyakpūjyāprayatnataḥ
evamevayajedagnauhomādāvapirāghavaṃ tarppaṇādāvapijalepyevamārādhyatarppayet śālagrāmaśilāyāṃcatulasī

<pṛ0 16ba> tulasīdalakalpitā pūjāśrīrāmacaṃdrasyakoṭikoṭiguṇādhikā pratimāyāṃca (. . . .) bhūmāvagnauvivasvani jalevā
hṛdayevāpividhāyadraha (. . . . .) kīlecaipopacārāṇāṃpūjayettulasīdalaiḥ ghaṃṭāṃcavādayeddadyāddevāyācamanī
yakaṃ madhyemadhyecatattaccanatvānatvāsamarpayet mukulaiḥpatitaścaivaṣaṃḍitaiśśoṇitairapi anarhairapipuṣpaiścadalaiḥ
patraicanārcayet yenakenāthapuṣpera(. .)treṇāthadalenavā yataḥkutaścidānīyayatrakutrodbhavenavā bhavārthaṃjīvanārthaṃ
canārcayedgarhitesthale gaṃgāyāṃgopradānenadivyavarṣaśatatrayaṃ yatphalaṃprāpyatenityamārādhyāpnotitaddhariṃ patraṃpu
ṣpaṃphalaṃcāpirāmārādhanasādhanaṃ dadyādārādhitoyovaitasyapuṇyaphalaṃśṛṇu kurukṣetrecagaṃgāyāṃprayāgepuruṣotta
me gosahasrapradānenayattatphalamavāpyate tadetadakhilaṃpuṇyaṃprāpnotyevanasaṃśayaḥ samagramasamagraṃvāyodadyātpūjitaṃ
hareḥ kadācidapinityaṃvāyodadyātpūjitaṃbahu kiṃtīrthasevayādānairanyaibahubhirīritaiḥ ārādhanāsamarthaścadadyādarca(-)
nasādhanaṃ pradātuṃnaivaśaknotikuryyādarcanadarśanaṃ nistārāyacadevānāṃbhavāvdemunisattama naikaṃcayasyavidyetasaudhāyā
tyevanānyathā niyamavyatirekeṇayaḥkuryyāddevatārcanaṃ kiṃcidapyasyanaphalaṃbhasmanībahutaṃyathā yorcayedvidhiva
dbhaktyāparānītaiścasādhanaiḥ pūjāphalārddhamevāsyanasamagraphalaṃlabhet yastubhaktyāprayatnenasvayaṃsaṃpādyacākhi
laṃ sādhanaṃcārcayedvidvānsasamagraphalaṃlabhet parāropitavṛkṣebhyaḥpuṣpāṇyānīyacārcayet tattanmudrāṃtarāṇyeva

<pṛ0 17a> darśayeccaivasādaraṃ prāsādyasumukhīkṛtyasannidhāpyacapūjayet sakalīkṛtyatatprāṇāstadānīmiṃdriyāṇyapi yadyevaṃ
pūjayedrāmaṃbhuktiṃmuktiṃcaviṃdati (51) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃtrayodaśodhyāyaḥ] (13) || agastyuvāca
vidhivatsaṃskṛtepyagnaudevamāvāhyapūjayet pūrvoktenaivavidhināsāṃgāvaraṇavāhanaṃ vidhiṃtasyapravakṣyāmiyene
ṣṭaṃsādhyatephalaṃ vihitaṃyenatiṣṭaṃtitevaphalabhājanāḥ sarveṣāmīpsitānāṃcaanyathācettathānahi nyāyārji
taiḥsādhanaiścadānahomārcanādikaṃ kuryyānnacedadhoyātibhaktyākurvannapidvijaḥ bhūmisthānaṃsamīkṛtyaṣaṭcatuṣkāṃgu
lāṃtaraṃ tāvattuniṣanedaṃtacatuṣkoṇaṃtathāttataḥ diśidiśyaṃtaracaivapārśvasthalacatuṣṭayaṃ evaṃsalakṣaṇaṃkṛtvāvahiḥ
kuryyāccamekhalāṃ dvādaśāṣṭacaturmmānāṃsvāṃgulaiścakramātmane evamutsedhamāyāmacaturaṃgulamevatat āyāmotsedha
rūpeṇacatuṣkādhikyataḥkramāt catuṣkatritayaṃkuryyādevaṃsyānmekhalākramaḥ kuṃḍasyapaścimebhāgeyoniṃkuryyātsalakṣa
ṇaṃ aśvatthapatrasadṛśīṃkuṃḍekiṃcitpratiṣṭitāṃ ṣaṭcatuvyaṃgulāsācakramāttiptābhavetpunaḥ vistāreṇāpisāyoni
rbhavatyevaṃdaśāṃgulā mūlaṃnālaṃtathāgraṃcavyutkramātṣaṭcatustrikaṃ tanmānāṃgulimānaṃsyāttadetatkuṃḍalakṣaṇam 
ekahastasyakuṃḍasyaprakāroyaṃpradarśitaḥ dvihastakuṃḍamapyevaṃdviguṇīkṛtyamekhalāṃ nābhirapyathavākuṃḍamekame
khalakaṃbhavet saṃkṣepakarmasutathāvartulasyāpilakṣaṇaṃ catuṣkoṇaikahastasyamadhyekuṃḍalalāṃchanaṃ samannidhāya

<pṛ0 17ba> sūtreṇabhrāmayedabhitomune koṇeṣuyadvā(saṃsthā)pyadhikaṃtadvikṣvevavinirdiśet idaṃtuvartulaṃkuṃḍaṃtataḥsyādarddhacaṃ
drakaṃ diśicottarataḥkuṃḍapāṇibhāgārddhabhāgataḥ bahiraiṃdryāścavāruṇyāyatnāmadhyetulāṃchayet saṃsthāpyabhrāma
yedetadarddhacaṃdraṃśubhapradaṃ mekhalāsvaṣṭapatrāṇivartulasyataponidhe padmākāraṃbhavedetatkuṃḍaṃsarvaphalapradaṃ śata
homeratnimātretadarddhaṃmuṣṭisammitaṃ sahasrepyayutepyarddhalakṣelakṣepicakramāt paṃcapaṃcāṃgulādhikyādvarddhateratnimā
trataḥ kuṃḍaṃcakoṭihomepitadarddhepikaṣāṣṭakaṃ muṣṭyaratnimitetaccadaśadvādaśaṣoḍaśa tatkrameṇāṃkulīnāṃcapra(-)
thamāmekhalābhavet dvitīyecatṛtīyecatryaṃśetryaṃśevinirdiśet sarveṣāmapikuṃḍānāmaṃgulidvayavṛddhijaḥ pratha
māmekhalākāryātryaṃśepyanyātupūrvavat kaṃṭhoṣṭaṃyavamātraṃsyātkuṃḍecakaramātrake kuṃḍeṣaṭyavamātraṃsyātkaṃṭhoratnipra
māṇake tathācaturyyavaiḥkaṃṭhomuṣṭimātrevinirdiśet sarveṣāmapikuṃḍānāmaṃgulidvayavṛddhitaḥ prathamāmekhalākā
ryātryaṃśepyanyātupūrvavat kaṃṭhoṣṭaṃyavamātraṃsyātkaṃṭhoratnipramāṇake tathācaturyyavaiḥkaṃṭhomuṣṭimātrevinirdiśet
sarveṣukuṃḍamāneṣuaṃgulidvayavṛddhitaḥ kaṃṭhoyatnenakartavyobhuktimuktiphalepsubhiḥ sāttvikīrājasīcaivatāmasīca
kramādbhavet prathamācadvitīyācatṛtīyācakramādbhavet prathamācadvitīyācatṛtīyācakramādbhavet yonukuṃḍānu
sāreṇakuryyādādyaṃtamadhyataḥ uktāṃgulipramāṇenadviguṇaṃcacaturguṇaṃ homasaṃkhyānavidhināsarvalakṣaṇalakṣitaṃ

<pṛ0 18a> sruvaṃvāhupramāṇenahomārthaṃvidadhītavai caturasraṃvidāyādausaptapaṃcāṃgulakramāt tṛtīyāṃśenavartaḥsyāttadaṃtarvitta
saṃmitaṃ khātvāsamaṃtiryagūrddhaṃtadadhaḥśodhayedvahiḥ caturthāṃśaṃcāṃgulasyarekhātvarddhaṃtadaṃtataḥ ramyāṃcamekhalāttasyaśi
ṣṭenārddhenakārayet kuryyādvibhāgavistārāmaṃgulenasamāvṛtāṃ sārddhamaṃguṣṭakaṃvāsyāttadagraṃtumukhaṃbhavet caturaṃgula
vistāraṃpaṃcāṃgulamathāpivā tritayāṃgulakaṃtasyamadhyāṃtaṃtusuśobhanaṃ śuṣiraṃkuṃbhadeśesyādviśedyāvatkanīyasī śe
ṣaṃkuṃḍaṃtukartavyayathārucivicitrikaṃ catuḥkoṇasamāyuktohastamātraḥsucobhavet duṣṭakaṃśobhanaṃvṛttaṃdvyaṃgulaṃvidadhī
tavai yathālpapaṃkegauḥpādaṃruciraṃdṛśyateyathā palāśapatreniḥkṣidreruciresruksruvaumune vidadhyādvāśutthapatresaṃkṣi
ptehomakarmaṇi tataḥkuṃḍasthalaṃsamyakvāyavyevidadhītavai tatrāṣṭapatrakamalaṃvṛttatrayaparivṛtaṃ somasūryāgniviṃvetu
tathākuryyādvicakṣaṇaḥ caturasraṃbahisthāpyaṣaṭkoṇaṃkarṇikāṃtare pītaṃpūrvaṃsitaṃdeyaṃpaścimepyuttaraṃtathā raktaṃtuda
kṣiṇekṛṣṇaṃpāṭalaṃvahnisaṃsthitaṃ nainṛtenīlavarṇaṃtuvāyavyedhūmravarṇakaṃ eśaigauraṃvinirdiṣṭamaṣṭapatreṣvayaṃkramaḥ śaṃkhaṃ
cakraṃgadāṃpadmaṃdhanurvāṇāṃścamaṃḍale viliṣedvarṇakaiḥsamyaktatrarāmaṃsamarcayet kuṃḍāṃtarepyevamevārādhyajuhuyānmune
ādauvahnimukhaṃkuryyādupaviṣṭaḥsuviṣṭare prāṇānāyamyamanasājapenmaṃtramananyadhīḥ yāvanmarutsaṃcaratisarvāṃgeṣva
piniścalaḥ saṃkalpasthaṃḍilekuṃḍekṛtvālekhāścamadhyataḥ ūrdhvaṃtiryaktisrevavahnimaṃtrādadhītavai prokṣyopasāryata

<pṛ0 18ba> tpaścāddhṛtvāviṣṭaramādarāt lakṣmīṃṛtumatītatraprabhornārāyaṇasyaca grāmyadharmeṇasaṃjātamagniṃtatraviciṃtayet prama
thyavidhinaivāgnimāhitāgnegṛhādapi ānīyacādadhīttatrakuśaiḥprakṣālayatnataḥ saṃprekṣyayājñikaiḥkāṣṭaiḥpunaḥprakṣāla
yedapi prāṇāyāmaṃtataḥkuryyātparistīryakuśāṃkaraiḥ svagṛhyoktavidhānenavāsudevādibhirmune pātrāṇyasādhyavidhiva(-)
dvidhāmaṃtreṇataṃtravit tānyavīkṣapavitreṇacottānānividhānica punaḥprokṣaṇayetpātraṃpavitrepūryaśubhāṃvunā dattvākṣa(-)
tvānpavitraṃcatatonyatrividhānica diśyuttarasyāṃtatpātraṃpraṇītetyucyatevudhaiḥ tatrārcayetprabhuṃviṣṇuṃvrahmāṇaṃcārkamarcaye
t ājyasaṃskṛtyavidhivatsvasaṃpannamitivruvan garbhadānādikaṃvahnevivāhaṃtaṃsamācaret aṣṭāvaṣṭaucataraṇehyekaika
syatukarmaṇaḥ juhuyādarcitevahnauvauṣaḍaṃtaṃsamāpyaca karmāṃtaraṃsamārabhyatadaṃtecasamāpayet evamagnausvasaṃpannevai
ṣṇavaṃjuhvayātcaruṃ idhmādhānādyagnimukhā'jyabhāgaujuhuyātpunaḥ saṃgāvāhanamaṃtrāgnaupūjayedraghunaṃdanaṃ samidājyaca
rāṇāṃcapratyekaṣoḍaśāhutiḥ juhuyānmūlamaṃtreṇaparivārebhyevaca tisrovināyakādibhyasarvebhyopyāhutīrmune dvārā
ṇāparivārebhyasurebhyojuhuyātpunaḥ hutvājyenāhutistatrapradadyāttattadāptaye tattadravyaiścajuhuyātpratyekaṃcamano
haraṃ dvārapīṭhasurebhyaścahutvādaujuhuyāttataḥ aṃgādivaiṣṇavebhyaścājyāhutīpṛthakpṛthak tataḥsviṣṭikṛtaṃhutvā
ghṛtenamunisattama jalenavidhināsamyakpariṣicyasamaṃtataḥ praṇītāmārjanaṃkṛtvādadyāccavrahmadakṣiṇāṃ svasvavittānu

<pṛ0 19a> sāreṇalobhamohavivarjitaḥ tatovrahmāṇamudvāsyavrāhmaṇānbhojayettataḥ agnimadhyaṃgataṃdevaṃpunaḥsvātmaniyojayet
ekībhūtaṃviciṃtyaivavācayetsvastivācanaṃ āśīrvacobhirviduṣāmedhyamānaḥsukhībhavet hutaśeṣaṃtataḥprāśyaku
