nārāyaṇaḥsvayaṃrāmaḥśiṣyesannidadhītavai sarvataḥsarvagopyastiprasīdatidayānidhiḥ itisaṃskṛtyasaṃmmṛtyatajjalairabhiṣecayet
paridhāyacavāsāṃsicaṃdanādivilipyaca kuṃḍalyānyaṃgurīyaṃcadhārayitvānyasettataḥ vaiṣṇavīṃmātṛkāṃcaivatatvanyāsaṃtathaivaca
tanmūrtipaṃjaraṃnyāsamṛṣyādinyāsamevaca pūrvavadvidhivacchiṣyatanāvevapravinyaset tatastacchirasisvasyahastaṃdatvāśataṃja
pet aṣṭottaraśataṃmaṃtrodadyādudakapūrvakaṃ prayatnenavadastasmaiśiṣyāyamunipuṃgava svatojyotirmayīṃvidyāṃgacchaṃtībhāvaye
dguruḥ āgatāṃbhāvayecchiṣyodhanyosmītiviśeṣataḥ kṛtakṛtyastataḥśiṣyastasmaisarvaṃnivedayet yaccayāvaccayadbhaktyāguravehṛ
ṣṭacetanaḥ gobhūhiraṇyavipinagṛhakṣetrādikaṃmune nacedarddhaṃtadardhaṃvādaśāṃśamathavāpivā akleśādannavastrādidadyādvittānu
sārataḥ prakārāṃtaramālaṃbyaguruṃyatnenatoṣayet guruputrakalatrādīṃstoṣayedvahubhiḥsvayaṃ arhaṇādiścabahubhirbhaktyāchāda
nabhūṣaṇaiḥ evamuktaprakāreṇaguravedattadakṣiṇāḥ kṛtakṛtyaṃtathātmānaṃ (. . .) viprāṃścabhojayet tebhyopidakṣiṇāṃdattvāsarva
tatparitoṣayet vrāhmaṇīrvacobhiścagurvāśīrbhiḥsamedhitaḥ visarjayeccagurvādīnstatobhuṃjītamaṃtravit evaṃlavdhamanurvipnaḥ

<pṛ0 24a> kṛtārthasyānnasaṃśayaḥ tadātisaṃdhyāṃkurvītaniyatogurvanujñayā sāyaṃprātaścamadhyāhnerāmaṃdhyātvāmanuṃjapet jalaṃmaṃtreṇasaṃśo
dhyakavacenāṃvaguṃṭhyaca cakrīkṛtyajalesamyakdarbhamūlenamaṃtravit āvahanādimudrābhistīrthamāvāhyapūjayet vrahmāṃḍoda
ratīrthānikaraiḥsṛṣṭāniteraveḥ tenasatyenamedevatīrthaṃdehidivākaraḥ gaṃgecayamunecaivagodāvarisarasvati narmadesiṃdhukā
verījalesminsannidhiṃkuru evaṃcārādhyamāvāhyavidhivattajjalaṃmune ādāyāṃjalināsamyakjapenmālāmanuṃsakṛt ja
laṃdakṣiṇahastasthaṃsavyahasteviniḥkṣipet tatorāmohamasmītigāyatrīṃniyatojapet janmaprabhṛtiyatpāpaṃdaśabhirvāpi
saṃcitaṃ purākṛtaṃsatenāpisahasreṇajapenavā vadeddaśarathāyetividmahetipadaṃtataḥ sītāpadaṃsamuddhṛtyavallabhāyatatova
det dhīmahityapitannaucarāmaścāpipracodayāt eṣāsyādrāmagāyatrībhuktimuktipradāyinī puraścaraṇamasyāsti
caturlakṣajapāvadhi yaccayāvaccapūjādisarvaṃpūrvavadācaret omādireṣāgāyatrīmuktimevaprayachati māyādirapi
vaiduṣyaṃ ramādiścaśriyaṃmune madanenāpisaṃyuktāsaṃmohayatimedinīmanayārādhitorāmaḥsarvābhīṣṭaṃprayacchati 
tarpayeccatatomūlamaṃtroścāraṇapūrvakaṃ stuvaṃścapraṇamanrāmayayāśaktyāmunīśvara kṛtvaivaṃpratyahaṃsamyaktrisaṃdhyaṃ
cayathāvidhiḥ kṛtakṛtyobhavenmaṃtrīsatyaṃsatyaṃcanānyathā || (62) || [ityagastyasaṃhitāyāṃsaptadaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
(17)|| 

<pṛ0 24ba> agastyuvāca athapūjāvidhānānāṃlakṣaṇānyapivacmahe aṃvucaṃdanapuṣpāṇidhūpadīpanivedanaṃ haviretānimu(-)
khānisādhanānimunīśvara sthūlamapyarddhapātrāṇiśaṃkhaṃcaiṣāṃcalakṣaṇaṃ anyāniveditaśuddhiṃprakṛtisthaṃsuśītalaṃ
hemādikalaśaṃtasyapūjāsādhanamiṣyate ananyārpitapūtānigaṃdhavaṃtisitānica pītānyapimanojñānichidreṇa
rahitānica puṣpāṇyevātraśaṃsaṃtinacetsarvaṃnirarthakaṃ caṃdanaṃmalayotpannamanāghrātaṃsuśītalaṃ karpūrāgurukastūrī
himāchādivivāsitaṃ pūjāyāṃśasyatedhūpastāmrakāṃsyādinirmite pātrepidvipadelagnanālepadmākṛtaumune sā
rāṃgāraviniḥkṣipteguggulāgaravṛkṣaje niryyāsādyutthitairdhūpai rgaṃdhadravyaiścacottamaiḥ ananyārpitagaṃdhoyaṃśasyatercanaka
rmaṇi dīpopipūrvavatpātremaṃḍalākārakāritaḥ pratipūrvapradīptaścavartyāgavyaghṛtādinā anyāniveditaḥpūjāka
rmaṇyevapraśasyate pāyasāpuṣpasaṃpādyaṃphalorpetaṃharirmune śuddhaṃcapaḍrasopetamananyārpitamiṣyate naivedyamarcanenānyaṃ
satāṃvūlaniveditaṃ sthalaṃprasādavipinanadītīragataṃsamaṃ caturasraṃcaturhastaṃhastonnatasuvedikaṃ caṃdrātapapatākādi
toraṇairprolasacchuciḥ viviktaṃcaviśeṣeṇaśasyatercanakarmaṇi pātrāṇitāmrahemādinirmitānijalāṃtare jalajā
nīvanirmāyapādyādyarcārhaṇādiṣu upacārāṇiśuddhāniśasyaṃtetraviśeṣataḥ śaṃkhonāmasamāvartaḥpṛṣṭamadhyanunāla
kaḥ sitaiścapūritonīraiḥśasyatercanakarmaṇi etānyanyānipūjāyāṃsādhanānibahūnica tānyuttamānimadhyāninyū

<pṛ0 25a> nānividhivaṃtivai sukhyaḥsamarthaḥkurvītacottamairevasādhanaiḥ madhyamomadhyamairevanyūnonyūnaistapodhana āpannaścetsama
rthopinyūnairevasamācaret pūjākarmaviśeṣeṇadeśakālānusārataḥ yathāśaktiyathānyāyaṃyathathālokavigarhitaṃ eke
navānyatsakalākuryyāddevārcanaṃrahaḥ mudrāścadarśayetpaścāddevasānnidhyakāriṇī darśitāstāścadevānāṃdrāvakānmo
dakānmune darśanīyāḥsutīkṣṇātodevatāyāgakarmaṇi āvāhanīsthāpanīcasānnidhīkariṇītathā susannirodhinī
mudrāsammukhīkaraṇītathā sakalīkaraṇaṃcaivamahāmudrātathaivaca śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadhanuḥkaustubhagāruḍāḥśrīvatsavana
mālecayonimudrāṃcadarśayan mūlādhāradvādaśāṃtamānītaḥkusumāṃjaliḥ tristhānagatatejobhivinītapratimādi
ṣu āvāhanīyaṃmudrāsyādevārcanavidhaumune eṣaivāsyaivamudrāsyā(. . . .)tsannirodhinī uttānamuṣṭiyugalāsammukhīka
riṇīmatā anyeṣvevāṃgavinyāsaḥsakalīkaraṇaṃbhavet anyonyāṃguṣṭasaṃlagnāvistāritakaradvayī mahāmudreyamākhyā
tānyūnādhikasamāpanīkaniṣṭānāmikāmadhyātarjanīmukulīkṛtā karadvayenamudrāsyācchaṃkhākhyeyaṃsurārcane anyo(-)
nyābhimukhaṃpṛṣṭāṃgulipronnatamadhyamāḥ athāṃguṣṭadvayaṃmadhyedatvāpiparitaskarau maṃḍalīkaraṇaṃsamyagaṃgulīnāṃtapodhana
padmamudrābhavedeṣādhenumudrātataḥparaṃ anāmikekaniṣṭābhyāṃtarjanībhyāṃcamadhyame anyonyābhimukhāśliṣṭetataḥkau(-)
stubhasaṃjñakāḥ kaniṣṭenyonyasaṃlagnesammukhepiparasparaṃ vāmasyatarjanīmadhyemadhyānāmikayorapi vāmānāmikasaṃspṛ

<pṛ0 25ba> ṣṭātarjanīmadhyamagatā paryyāyeṇanamāṃguṣṭadvayīkaustubhalakṣaṇā kaniṣṭānyonyasaṃlagnāviparītānniyojitā a
dhasthātprāpitāṃguṣṭāmudrāgaruḍasaṃjñatā tarjanyaṃguṣṭamadhyasthāmadhyamānāmikādvayī kaniṣṭānāmikāmadhyatarjanyagraka
radvayī muneśrīvatsamudreyaṃvanamālābhavettataḥ kaniṣṭānāmikāmadhyāmuṣṭirunnitatarjanī paribhrāṃtāśirasyuccaiḥ
starjanībhyāṃdivaukasaḥ mudrāyoniḥsamākhyātātatkaradvayadarśinī tarjanyākṛṣṭamadhyācatatonāmikayugmakāḥ
madhyemūlasthitāṃguṣṭājñeyāśāstrārcanemune etābhirdaśamudrābhiḥpūrvoktābhiścasaptabhiḥ yorāmamarcayennityaṃmoda
yetsasureśvaraṃ drāvayedapivipeṃdratataḥprārthitamāpnuyāt lakṣaṇānyāsanānāṃhivakṣyāmimunisattama tānisvasti
kavajrābjavīrādīnibhavaṃtivai kṛtottānaukṣitaupādautatraivorudvayaṃsamaṃ nidhāyaniścalaṃhyetatśreṣṭaṃsarveṣukarmmasu
vāmāṃkāgrekṛtaṃhyetadvīrāsanamudāhṛtaṃ yogāsanaṃcamuṣkādhaḥpārṣṇidatvāpadāṃtaraṃ yadyāṃkayornidhāyaitadyogībhīṣṭaṃpra
yachati vāmāṃkapārśvapārṣṇīcadakṣiṇāṃceddvayaṃpunaḥ pārṣṇyaṃtaraṃnidhāyaikaṃkuryyājjānudvayaṃsamaṃ gomukhāsanametatsyā
tsarvāghaughavināśanaṃ āsanānivahūnisyurevamevajapādiṣu yenakenāsanedhīnedhīraḥsthitvājapādiṣu kurvītabhaktiyukta
stubhāvayetpuruṣottamaṃ evaṃyaḥkurutepūjāṃjapahomādikaṃmune sarveṣāmihapūjyo mihalokeparatraca pūjājapaścaho
maścamaṃtrāṇāmāhutistathā dīkṣābhiṣekamārgopidarśitastetapodhana pūjopakaraṇādīnāṃlakṣaṇānyapisuvrata darśitā

<pṛ0 26a> niprayatnenasarvabhaktyāvadhāraya sutīkṣṇābhihitaṃyadvadvaiṣṇavaṃbhuktimuktidaṃ nāvaiṣṇavebhyovaktavyaṃnaśrāvyamitimematiḥ
yatnenaviṣṇubhaktāyaarthitedeyamevahi (56) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāmaṣṭādaśodhyāyaḥ] (18) || agastyuvāca
sutīkṣṇamaṃtravaryyeṣuśreṣṭovaiṣṇavucyate gāṇapatyeṣuśaiveṣuśaktisaureṣvabhīṣṭadaḥ vaiṣṇaveṣvapisarveṣurāmamaṃtraphalā(-)
dhikaḥ gāṇapatyādimaṃtreṣukoṭikoṭiguṇādhikaḥ maṃtrasteṣvapyanāyāsaphaladoyaṃṣaḍakṣaraḥ ṣaḍakṣaroyaṃmaṃtrastusa
rvāghaughavināśanaḥ maṃtrarājitiproktaḥsarveṣāmuttamottamaḥ dainaṃdinaṃtuduritaṃpakṣamāsartuvarṣajaṃ sarvaṃdahatiniḥśeṣa
sūrṇācalamivānalaḥ vrahmahatyāsahasrāṇijñānājñānakṛtānica svarṇasteyasurāpānagurutalpāyutānica koṭi
koṭisahasrāṇiupapātakajānyapi sarvāṇyapisamaṃyāṃtirāmamaṃtrānukīrtanāt bhūtapretapiśādyāḥkūṣmāṃḍagraharākṣa
sāḥ dūrādevapradhāvaṃtirāmamaṃtraprabhāvataḥ mālinyamapisāṃkaryyayadyadyāvaccadūṣitaṃ sarvaṃvilayamāpnotirāmamaṃtrenu
kīrtite āvrahmavījadoṣāścaniyamātikramodbhavāḥ strīṇāṃcapuruṣāṇāṃsyurmaṃtreṇānenanāśitāḥ yeṣuyeṣvapideśeṣu
rāmaḥparamupāsyate durbhikṣādibhayānyeṣunabhavaṃtikadācana śāṃtaḥprasannovarado'krodhanobhaktavatsalaḥ anenasadṛ
śomaṃtrojapatsvapinavidyate anenārādhitorāmaḥprasīdatyevasattvaraṃ dadātyāpuṣpamaiśvaryaṃsamānottamatāmapi ye
vamuktamātreṇamaṃtrārādhanatatparaḥ sakāmobhuktimāpnotiniṣkāmomuktirevaca prāpnotyabhayakāmostubhuktiṃmuktiṃnasaṃśayaḥ

<pṛ0 26ba> sutīkṣṇuvāca śrutismṛtipurāṇārthaniścayajñānavittamaḥ saṃdehaṃchiṃdipṛchāminānātrānugrahaṃkuru ātmānubhavarūpeṇasā
kṣātkāreṇakevalaṃ punarāvṛttirahitaṃśāśvataṃvrahmayātyapi itiśrutyāditattvajñāḥpravadaṃtimanīṣiṇaḥ śrīmatābhihitaṃrā
maṃmaṃtrānuṣṭānatatparāḥ bhuktiṃmuktiṃcaviṃdaṃtikathametinibodhaya nivṛttirevamuktistupravṛttirbhuktirucyate ubhayorapye
karevakathaṃmārgābhavedvada tvayācaivayaduktaṃtatsatyaṃsatyaṃvadāṃvara sarvajanyasukhochittirduḥkhochittiścatattvataḥ nivṛtti
lakṣaṇāhyetāmuktirityabhidhīyate viṣayātyaṃtasaṃsargaṃkaraṇānāṃhṛdāsaha bhuktiṃpracakṣatelokevaiṣamyamubhayoriha
tathāpyātmānasaṃdhānamubhayatrāpidṛśyate muktirātmānusaṃdhānenātmāvasthānamevahi etadastevatattvajñasarvatattvavidāṃ
satāṃ pravṛttaucanivṛttāścasarvadātmānubhāvināṃ kiṃcarāmohamityevasarvadānusaraṃtivai natesaṃsāriṇonūnaṃrāmeva
nasaṃśayaḥ rāmevātrabhoktācabhojyamāryyabhujikriyā ekasminnevaśiṣṭetukimasatsaprasaṃjanaṃ atonamuktimārga(-)
syarodhinībhuktiriṣyate anenavidhinārāmaṃyenamanutiṣṭati sabhuktimapimuktiṃcalabhatenātrasaṃśayaḥ yathāvi
dhiniṣedhautumuktiṃcaivapasarpataḥ tathānaspṛśatārāmopāsakaṃvidhipūrvakaṃ sadārāmohamityevaciṃtayedapyananya
dhīḥ natasyāvihitaṃlokeniṣiddhaṃcanavidyate atorāmohamityevatātparyyeṇavadaṃtiye rāmonāmatevasyunnateṣāṃ
vihitādikaṃ dātavyamasmaidadatiyeyāvatkiyadanvahaṃ udakaudanavastrāṇirāmāyaivanaśaṃsayaḥ atovrahmavidedatta

<pṛ0 27a> mānaṃtyāyaivakalpyate yedviṣaṃtyapiniṃdaṃtitatpāpaphalabhājanāḥ kuṃṭuṃbinodaridrāsyurduḥkhinnaḥsyurnasaṃśayaḥ tataḥ
sutātsamutpādyasvayamevadahedapi kārāgṛheṣusarveṣunirnimittaṃnagṛhyate ahosyamaṃdabhāgyasyayāvattadvikṣayaṃbhavet
atobrahmavidāṃdveṣonakartavyaphalepsubhiḥ niṃdācanaivakartavyāhitamevasamācaret yestuvaṃtyanumodaṃtidadaṃtyasmaimanī
ṣiṇaḥ tatpuṇyamakhilaṃlavdhātadgataṃprāpnuvaṃtyapi jñātvātamevamātmānaṃkṛtyaṃkuruniraṃtaraṃ etenaivatavābhīṣṭaṃsarvaṃbhava
tinānyathā tyajadarśanagoṣṭīṃcavihārechāṃsamācara hitamevasatāṃnityamahiṃsāparamobhava tatprāptisādhanānyaṣṭau
tānivakṣyāmitacchṛṇu yamoniyamasaṃjñaścāsanaṃcatṛtīyakaṃ prāṇāyāmaścaturthaṃsyātpratyāhārastupaṃcamaḥ dhāra
ṇācatathādhyānaṃsamādhiritisattataḥ pratyekameṣāṃvakṣyāmilakṣaṇānyapisuvrata tadvibhajyapravakṣyāmitattallakṣaṇama
pyahau ahiṃsāsatyamasteyaṃvrahmacaryaṃdayārjavaṃ kṣamādhṛtimitāhāraḥśaucaṃvettiyamādaśa sarveṣāmapijaṃtūnāma
kleśajananaṃpunaḥ vāṃmanaḥkarmabhirnūnamahiṃsītyabhidhīyate tṛṇāderapyanādānaṃparasvasyatapodhana asteyametada
pyaṃgaṃvrahmaprāptyaisanātanaṃ avasthāsvapisarvāsukarmaṇāmanasāgirā strīsaṃgatiparityāgovrahmacaryyaṃpracakṣya
te pareṣāṃduḥkhamālokyasvasyaivālocyatasyatu tatsādhanānusaṃdhānaṃdayetiprocyatevudhaiḥ vyavahāreṣusarveṣu
manovākkāyakarmabhiḥ sarveṣāmapikauṭilyaṃrāhityaṃhyārjavaṃbhavet sarvātmanāsarvadāpisarvatraivāpakāripu

<pṛ0 27ba> vaṃdhuṣvivasamācāraḥkṣāṃtisyānmunisattama icchāprayatnarāhityaṃjāteṣuviṣayeṣvapi lobhavatsudhṛtiṃdhīrāḥpravadaṃtisa(-)
tāṃvaraḥ bhojyasyaivacaturthāṃśabhojanaṃsvasyacetasaḥ atyuktakaṭutiktāmlalavaṇādivivarjitaṃ hitaṃmedhyaṃsutīkṣṇaṃ
tatmithyāhāraṃpracakṣyate nirgataṃromakūpebhyonavaraṃdhrebhyevaca malaṃvadaṃtidvārāṇāṃkṣālanaṃśaucamucyate mṛjja(-)
lābhyāṃvahiḥsamyaknirmalīkaraṇaṃpunaḥ pūrvoktabhūtaśudhyaṃtaṃśaucamācakṣatevudhāḥ etedaśayamābrahmastadvrahmaprā(-)
ptihetavaḥ tapaścatuṣṭirāstikyamīśvarārādhanaṃtathā siddhāṃtāvekṣaṇaṃcaivalajjādānamatistathā japovrataṃdaśaitā
nisutīkṣṇaniyamāsmṛtāḥ pratyekameṣāṃvakṣyāmilakṣaṇānitapodhana tapastvanaśanaṃnāmavidhipūrvakamiṣyate
anāyāsopavāsenatṛptyarthenaivajīvinaṃ tuṣṭireṣācadhāryyetatatprāptirnānyayāvinā śrutyāyuktetuviśvāsā
stikyasaṃpracakṣyate iṣṭadevārcanaṃsamyak vidhipūrvakamanvahaṃ trisaṃdhyamekadāvātubhavatyeveśvarārcanam vaiṣṇa
vāgamasiddhāṃtaśravaṇaṃmananaṃtathā śrutismṛtipurāṇādimadhyāhnānorkadarśanaṃ siddhāṃtaśravaṇaṃhyet procya
tetattvadarśibhiḥ śrutyādibhirlaukikaiścayadyadatyaṃtaniṃditaṃ tatrāpravartanaṃlajjāvāṃmanaḥkarmaṇāmapi yadiṣṭa
devatāṃdhyātvātadarppaṇadhiyānvahaṃ tatpātraidīyatennāditaddhyānamabhidhīyate gurorlavdhasyamaṃtrasyaśaśvadāvartanaṃ
cayat aṃtaraṃgākṣarāṇāṃcanyāsapūrvaṃjapobhavet kartavyasyasamagrasyaniyamagrahaṇaṃvrataṃ niyamavyatirekeṇasakalaṃni

<pṛ0 28a> ṣkalaṃbhavet yamaiścaniyamaścaivakṛtaṃyatsaphalaṃbhavet atoniyamataḥsarvaṃkṛtaṃsāphalyamāpnuyāt 65 || [itiśrīa
gastisaṃhitāyāmekoviṃśodhyāyaḥ] || (19) || agastyuvāca ekatraivasthitibhāvaḥpūrvoktairniyamaiḥsaha śūlārpitaśarī
rasyanaitadāsanamucyate prāṇāyāmānathauvakṣyemumukṣorupakārakān yaiḥkṛtaidahyateghaughaḥśuṣkeṃdhanagiriryathā iṃ
driyeṣvapidoṣāḥvātapittakaphodbhavāḥ tvagasṛṃmāṃsamedotthamajjāsthisitasaṃbhavāḥ etesarvepidahyeteprāṇasyāṃ
tarnirodhanāt prāyaścittamaghaughānāṃmukhyametadvadaṃtihi punarāvṛttirahitaśāśvatavrahmakāṃkṣibhiḥ prāṇāyāma(-)
ścasatataṃkartavyovidhivanmunai samyaṅnirudhyacaprāṇānaṃtaḥkaraṇamātmaniḥ svayamevāvasiṣṭaḥsanvrahmabhūyāya
kalpate jānuviṃbakarāgreṇatriparāmṛṣyasattvaraṃ pradadyācchoṭikāmekāmiyaṃmātrākanīyasī madhyamādviguṇācaiva
sājyeṣṭātriguṇāmatā adhamomadhyamaścaivaprāṇāyāmastathottamaḥ adhamaḥpaṃcadaśabhistriṃśadbhirmadhyamomataḥ mātrā
bhiruttamaḥpaṃcacatvāriṃśadbhirucyate prāṇāyāmaiḥkṛtaiḥśaśvannityaṃṣoḍaśabhirmune dainaṃdinaṃcayatpāpaṃtatsarvaṃnaśyatidhruvaṃ
paropatāpajaṃpāpaṃparadravyāpahārajaṃ parastrīmaithunotpannaṃprāṇāyāmaśataṃdahet mahāpātakajātānivrahmahatyāśatānica
sarvāṇyapipraṇaśaṃtiprāṇāyāmaiścatuḥśataiḥ ādāvaṃtecayatnenaprāṇāyāmātsamācaret karmasvapisamasteṣuaśubhe
śuśubheṣvavā prāṇāyāmairvināyadyatkṛtaṃkarmanirarthakaṃ atoyatnenakartavyāḥprāṇāyāmāśubhārthibhiḥ yāvacchakyaṃniya

<pṛ0 28ba> myāsūnmanasaivajapenmanuṃ rāmaṃrāmaṃmuhurmuhurdhyāyanpūrvoktavidhivatsudhīḥ dhārayannaṃtarevāsūnnetrekiṃcinnimīlyaca
