<pṛ0 31ba> svedajānitaponidhe yūkākīṭādirūpeṇaprakṣīyaṃtekṣaṇekṣaṇe jarāyujānyathotpattiṃprāpnuvaṃtiprabhāvataḥ svasyādṛ
