trasvāṃyesminbhavediha premābhijāyatelokesvasminnātsvopakārake nacennaivasamīcīnaṃyadanyādvāvilokyate 
vilakṣaṇānibhūtānitatkāryyaṃcatathāvidhaṃ svīyesvasminnivācāraḥ kathaṃtatpariśodhayan śrutismṛtipurāṇe
ṣusarvatrapratipāditaṃ sarvātmanāpicaitanyasarvamātmanināparaṃ sutīkṣṇuvāca|| loketattvaṃnajānātiyadyadevā 

<pṛ0 33a> vimarśitaṃ tatjñānādṛṣṭahānyātutatraivāṃtarhitaṃtapaḥ vubhutsusarvatattvajñonaṣṭavānapramādataḥ yadipaśyetparaṃjyotirekaṃ
sarvatrapaśyati tadananyamanāḥpaśyedidṛkṣurviṣayeṣvapi taccaitanyaṃparaṃpaśyennānyatkiṃcidapisvapi pāpiṣṭāḥkrūraka
rmānaḥtatonityaṃbahiḥkṛtāḥ tattatphalārthinaḥsarvekathaṃpaśyaṃtitadvada karasthaṃnaivajānātipramādādevaniścayaḥ a
tyaṃtāgarhitaṃvettivijijñāsustathāvidhaḥ paśyasarvātmanāsarvaṃsarvatrāpitaponidheḥ prakāśyatesvayaṃsākṣātsacci
dānaṃdalakṣaṇaṃ tatostinaparaṃkiṃcitsadvāsattadvilakṣaṇaṃ tattiraskaraṇīṃprāhuravidyāṃjñānināmapi yāmebhavatice
tāṃsiviṣayeṣvevacāmune dṛṣṭasyātsarvajaṃtūnāṃsukhaduḥkhādilakṣaṇāṃ adṛṣṭāṃtarhitāḥ sarvānāpisarvatrasaṃsthitāḥ
paśyaṃtipurataḥsākṣāccaitanyaṃsarvagocaraṃ śuddhimānapramattoyaḥkadācidviṣayairapi naivapralobhitaḥsākṣādātmānaṃpa
rimīkṣate evaṃvidhopiyaḥkaścitsaccidānaṃdalakṣaṇaṃ ātmānaṃsarvagaṃsamyakjānātyevanirākulaḥ sajīvannevamu
ktaḥsyādyadyevaṃvāsvaciṃtayet vahiḥsarvagamānīyacaitanyaṃsvagataṃpunaḥ pūrakenaivayogenasarvataḥsthitamaṃtataḥ
samyagādhāyacādhāredhyāyedrāmamananyadhīḥ śarīrāṃtargataṃvāyuṃdaśadhātatratatratu ekīkṛtyaprayatnenasamyaksa
rppamukhāṃkṛtiḥ vāyunāpūrakābhyāsaḥkartavyaḥsādhayettataḥ graṃthibhedakrameṇaivacaitanyāgnisamīraṇaiḥ uttīyapavanaṃya
tnātkuryāttanmukhagocaraṃ vidyutānaṃdacaitanyasamīrastanmukhāgataḥ nayedūrdhvaṃparaṃnunnaḥpunaḥpunarapisvayaṃ abhyāsāti

<pṛ0 33ba> śayenaivabhinayatpadyamananyadhīḥ tatparaṃparayātatraniḥsṛtāṃtaragocaraḥ bhūmauvīrāsanaṃbaddhamaṃtarālaṃbhavedapi punaryadyeya
mevāyadvitīyamapibhedayet tadaṃtāṃtargatovāyuḥśarīrecorddhamānayet hṛdayagraṃthibhedenasamyagabhyāsayogataḥ
tatrasaṃdhiṣusaṃbaṃdhatatrādyaṃtagatomahat samyaksaṃśodhyataddehabhrūmadhyamupasarpati tatrāsyadvidalepadmesudhānidhira
laukikaṃ amṛtaṃvāhayannaivaamṛtatvāyakalpyate bhiṃdetaṃpaṃcamasyaivaparvasyogregataṃpunaḥ tadevaṃnikhilaṃjñānaṃjanmā
pisaphalaṃtataḥ vairāgyeṇatadapyetityāgenaivahitatparaṃ saṃnyāsenaivayogīṃdranānyomārgostitasyatu vahiraṃtargataṃkṛtvā
mūlādhārāccacinmayaṃ dvādaśāṃtaṃsamutkramyayāvannāvartatepunaḥ yogīṃdranānyomārgoyaṃsarvasminnapidarśane naivāpyanuma
taṃbhinnaṃsarvairapisuśobhitaṃ virajenmanyasedvrahmasākṣātkuryyātsukhībhavet puruṣārthoyamevātraataḥkiṃcinnavidyate
akhaṃḍānaṃdayogenanaivātmānaṃviyojayet idaṃsatyamidaṃsatyaṃsatyaṃnaivāpivartate rāmaḥsatyaṃparaṃvrahmarāmātkiṃcinna
vidyate sarvaśāstrarahasyākṣamayātavamahātmanā agastyasaṃhitānāmaprokteyaṃsarvakāmadhuk adhyātmalokanedī
pakalikājñānanāśinī bhogamokṣapradānityamāyurārogyavarddhinī śrutādṛṣṭāpilikhitāvahiraṃtaścapāvaye
t ādimadhyāvasānāṃteyaḥśakṛdvānirīkṣyate pāpātmāpivimuktaḥsyādvrahmabhūyāyakalpate sarvadālocaye
dyastuvrahmavidyogasaṃjñitaṃ prāpnotilokamakhilaṃlabdhābhītimavāpnuyāt pustakaṃlikhitaṃyasyagehetiṣṭatipūji

<pṛ0 34a> taṃ āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃvarddhatesyadinedine putrapautraprapautrādyaiḥ kalamasyavivarddhate (50) [itiśrīagastisaṃhitā
yāṃtrayoviṃśodhyāyaḥ]|| (23) agastyuvāca || ayamevapuromārgākarmāpyetatparātparaṃ rāmevaparaṃjyotiḥsaccidānaṃda
paraṃjyotiḥprapaṃcātmātayeṣadvaṃdvamīḍāyoḥ śrutiḥsmṛtipurāṇānisamyagālocyaniścitaṃ vasiṣṭavāmadevādyairnāradādyai
ryyatastataḥ yajñoyamasmādbhūtānijaṃgamājaṃgamaṃtataḥ itaretaramiśrebhyastebhyobhūtāniyajñire sarvaprakāśamānoyaṃtate
vavinirgataḥ vyasteṣaivaśārīraḥparaḥsāravilakṣaṇaḥ paṃcātmāvarṇabhedenasopyamekavidhobhavet yadavākyādinā
yasyasarvasyāṃtonavidyate tasyakāraṇarūpatvādabhidhānābhidheyayoḥ upāsyaḥsaparaṃloketasminsarvapratiṣṭitaṃ yānyaṃ
prakāśayetsarvaṃparaṃjyotiḥsvataḥparaṃ yādirabhyudayātmatvāsarvadābhyudayopakṛt atoyatnenajapyaṃtumuktibhuktiparī(-)
psunā ataḥtataḥparaṃnāstitadetadvācakomanuḥ manūnāmapisarveṣāmayamevaviśiṣyate ayamevāṃtamutsṛjyakāramekā
kṣaromanuḥ upāsyamānoyajñoyamutpādayatitatparaṃ yadyetattritayaṃpyā(...) natyāsahasamuchritaṃ māyāmanmayavedādi
pūrvopyutkramapūrvakaḥ paṃcavarṇātmakastasmādyajñātsarvaṃprajāyate caṃdrāṃtaḥparamomaṃtrobhadrāṃtaścaturakṣaraḥ ehikāṃmu(-)
ṣpikāṃcāsyuktamevaphalaṃviduḥ śrīmāyāmanmathaikaikavījādyaṃtagatomanuḥ ṣaḍakṣaraḥsevāyaṃmaṃtraḥsyāccaturakṣaraḥ
tāramāyāramānaṃgavījapūrvaḥsevahi akṣaronekadhāproktaḥsarvābhīṣṭaphalapradaḥ caṃdrabhadranamaskāraistattadvījaiścayoji

<pṛ0 34ba> taḥ ṣaṭsaptāṣṭanavāditvenaivaṃbhinnopyanekadhā ekāditvenabahudhāsvayaṃrāmetyayaṃparaṃ sarvābhīṣṭaṃprayachaṃtināṃta
tvenāpibhidyate pādādyātmāpadādyātmātadviśeṣādviśiṣyate sevabhidyatenaṃtobhedenāpyadhikāriṇaṃ maṃtrāṇā
mṛṣireteṣāṃvrahmāgastyaḥśivopyahaṃ chaṃdogāyatryamevāhudevatārāmucyate pūrvāparaṃvījaśaktiṃbhuktimuktiprayo
janaṃ ādyaṃtayuktabījenaṣaḍaṃgaṃpraṇavaiḥsaha vāmadakṣiṇayovāmadakṣiṇāyobhruvordṛśoḥ karṇayorgaṃḍayorhanvoroṣṭa
yordaṃtamūlayoḥ jihvātanmūlayoḥkaṃṭhakakudoḥkucayorapi aṃśayorbhujayoḥpāṇyoḥpārśvayopṛṣṭahṛtkaṇai 
pṛṣṭinābhyoḥśakyiūrvojānvoścajaṃghayoḥpadau vinyasecchaktivījenasītārāmasvarūpakaṃ vinyasetsaṃhṛtinyā
saṃpādādikaśirovadhi utpattinyāsamapyatranābhyādimadharottaraṃ nyasetpratyakṣaraṃnyāsaṃmūrtinyāsamataḥparaṃ tattva
nyāsaṃkeśavāditannyāsamapivinyaset sarvāṃgamapisarveṇamaṃtreṇāpipravinyaset dhyāyeddhṛtpuṃḍarīkāṃtaṃparaṃjyotiḥ
parātparaṃ tatraivadevamabhyarcyamānasairupacārakaiḥ japetkvacanacaikāṃterāmaṃdhyāyananyadhīḥ ghanajīmūtasaṃkāśaṃvidyudva
rṇāṃvarāvṛtaṃ saṃtaptakāṃcanaprakhyāṃsītāmaṃkagatāṃpunaḥ anyonyāśliṣṭahṛdvāhunetraṃpaśyaṃtamādarāt dakṣiṇenakarāgre(-)
ṇacivukaṃkuṭilālakaṃ spṛṃśaṃtaṃcastanotsaṃgaṃparihāsaimuhurmuhuḥ vinodayaṃtaṃtāṃvūlacarvaṇaikaparāyaṇam sarva
rūpojvalaṃdvaṃdvaṃyoṣitpuruṣayoriva śrīrāmasītayoḥsarvasaṃpanmuktiphalapradaṃ japahomārcanādīnikuryyātkarmāṇi

<pṛ0 35a> saṃtataṃ yatkiṃcidapyanaṃtaṃsyātsatyaṃsatyaṃnasaṃśayaḥ tadetadvācakomaṃtraḥ sarvasyārthasyasādhakaḥ satasadvācakaścāyaṃmaṃ
trovijayateparaḥ rāmātmanomanaḥsadyaḥkīrtanāsmaraṇādapi vrāhmaṇaṃkṣatriyaṃvaiśyaṃśūdraṃhatvāpikalmaṣaṃ saṃcinotita
tomohādyadyattadapināśayet grāmāraṇyapaśughnatvaṃsaṃcitaṃduritaṃścayat niḥśeṣānnāśayatyevarāmātmādvyakṣaromanuḥ
unmṛṣyavācakoṇādibhavodbhavakṛtārcitaḥ madyapānenayatpāpaṃtadapyāśuvināśayet abhakṣyabhakṣaṇātpāpaṃmithyā
jñānasamudbhavaṃ sarvaṃvilayaterāmamaṃtrasyāsyasukīrtanāt śrotriyasvarṇaharaṇātyaccapāpamupārjitaṃ ratnāderapahā
reṇatadapyevaṃvināśayet gatvātumātaraṃmohādagamyāyāścayoṣitaḥ upasyānenamaṃtreṇarāmastadapināśayet
mahāpātakapāpiṣṭasaṃgatyāsaṃcitaṃcayat nāśayettatkathālāpaśayanāśanabhojanaiḥ pitṛmātṛvadhotpannaivuddhi
pūrvamaghaṃcayat niḥśeṣaṃnāśayatyevakālatrayasamudbhavaṃ bhrātṛmitrasvasṛghnānāṃyadvāviśvāsaghātakaḥ yadivālava
dhotpannaṃviṣaśastraścaghātakaṃ guruputrakalatrādivadhotpannaṃdurātmanāṃ tadanudhyānamātreṇasarvametatpralīyate ta
tsadgurūpadiṣṭenavartmanānuṣṭitaḥpunaḥ rāmātmāmanurevāyaṃpāparāśivināśakṛt yatprayāgāditīrtheṣuprāyaści
ttādikairapi naivāpanudyatepāpaṃtadapyāśuvināśayet ātmatulyasuvarṇādidānaivahuvidhairapi kiṃcidapiparī(-)
kṣāyāṃpāpaṃtadapināśayet nayātisaṃcitaṃpāpaṃbahumūlamaghaṃcayat tanmaṃtrasmaraṇādevaniḥśeṣaṃtatpraṇaśyati

<pṛ0 35ba> [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃcaturviṃśodhyāyaḥ] (24) || sutīkṣṇuvāca || sarvāṃgamekaṃtattvajñabrahmaniṣṭatapo
dhana rāmātmanastvayātattvaṃvrahmaṇaḥparamavyayaṃ pradarśitaṃsamyagevasavistṛtamanekadhā ṣaḍakṣaravidhānaṃtusamya
gjñānaṃtvayāvibho anyeṣāṃrāmamaṃtrāṇāṃmanuṣṭānaṃmahāmune ṣaḍakṣaravidhānaṃtuvidhānāṃtaramastivā sarvamevasamā
cakṣuḥbhaktasyamayisuvrata agastyuvāca sutīkṣṇaśṛṇuvakṣyāmiśraddadhānāyatepunaḥ bhaktasyatavayatnenayatastaṃvai
ṣṇavottamaḥ yeśṛṇvaṃtikathāṃviṣṇorvadaṃticaritaṃhareḥ muktakaṃṭhāścagāyaṃtiharinṛtyaṃtisusvaraṃ ānaṃdāśruparītātmā
gātraiṣupulakorcitaḥ ānaṃdanirbharaścaivapraskhalaṃtipadepade uścaiḥśrīrāmarāmetivadaṃticahasaṃtica evamādirguṇai
ryuktāātmārāmasamāhite vaiṣṇavāmanvaḥsarvemuktidāḥsyuḥkrameṇahi rāmamaṃtrāstuvipreṃdraśīghramuktipradāḥśṛ
ṇu vinaivadīkṣāṃvipreṃdrapuraścaryāvinaivahi vaiṣṇavanyāsavidhinājapamātreṇasiddhidāḥ sāmānyenatusarveṣāṃ
manūnāṃrāghavasyatu anuṣṭānavidhijñeyoviśeṣastatratatravai vakṣyatehimahābhāgayathāvidhisuvistaraṃ ṣaḍakṣaravidhā
naṃtusarveṣāṃprakṛtiṃviduḥ bhūtaśuddhividhātavyāsarveṣāmāditomune nyāsāḥpūrvaditāḥsarvekāryyāyatnenasuvrata ma
nuṣveteṣusarveṣāṃmadhikārostidehināṃ āśramasthāścasarvepimaṃtrāṇāmadhikāriṇaḥ mumukṣubhirviraktaiścasadāsevyo
raghūttamaḥ yatīnāṃyatacittānāmupāsyaḥpraṇavoyathādīkṣāvidhistupūrvoktāvidheyodeśikottamaiḥ saṃdhyāṃcadīkṣi

<pṛ0 36a> taḥkuryyāttattanmaṃtranusārataḥ prāṇāyāmastugāyatryāsarveṣāmapisattama jalābhimaṃtraṇaṃvāpimūlamṃtreṇamārjanaṃ jala
syaprāśanaṃvāpikṣepaṃcārghasyamārjanaṃ sītāṃmaṃtreṇakurvītamūlamaṃtrajapaṃtathā upasthānādikāḥkāryyātatraivadvijasattamaiḥ 
sūryyamaṃḍalamadhyasthaṃsītārāmasamanvitaṃ namāmipuṃḍarīkākṣaṃmāṃjaneyaguruṃparaṃ namostuvāmadevāyajyotiṣāṃpatayenamaḥ
sākṣiṇesarvalokānāṃparamānaṃdarūpiṇe raghunāthāyadivyāyamahākāruṇikāyaca namostukauśikānaṃdadāyineviśva
rūpiṇe trikālamevaṃyaḥkuryyādrāmevabhavetsvayaṃ puraścaryyātusarveṣāmuktamārgeṇaceṣpate evaṃsiddhamanurmaṃtrīpratyahaṃ
niyatavrataḥ caturbhujaṃśaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaṃvibhuṃ kirīṭinamudārāṃgaṃvanamālopaśobhitaṃ sītālaṃkṛtavāmāṃgaṃ
pītāṃbaradharaṃvibhuṃ śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃjvalaṃtaṃtejasāmune athavādvibhujaṃdevaṃnīlotpalasamadyutiṃ anekādi(-)
tyasaṃkāśaṃpadmasyoparisaṃsthitiṃ kāṃcanaprabhayādevyāvāmabhāgasthayānvitaṃ lakṣmaṇenadhṛtaṃchatraṃsuvarṇābhenadhīmatā
anekaiḥsevitaṃdivyaparivārairanekaśaḥ mānasairūpacārastusaṃpūjyayatnataḥparaṃ kalpavṛkṣasamudbhūtairbhāvitaṃmanasāciraṃ
mūlamaṃtraṃjapaṃkuryyānniyataṃniyateṃdriyaḥ bāhyapūjāṃtataḥkuryyātsādhanainyāyatojjitaiḥ anyāyenārjitaiḥpūjāniḥphalā
munisattama vāhyapūjāṃpunarvakṣesutīkṣṇamunisattamaḥ svagṛheśuddhabhūbhāgeviliptegaumayāṃvunā suvitānasamāyuktepu
ṣpādyaiḥsamalaṃkṛte gītavādyasuvṛttyaiścasarvataḥsamalaṃkṛte śuddhāsanesamāsīnamupacarairanekadhā caṃdanāgurukastū

<pṛ0 36ba> rīkarpūrakusumādibhiḥ himāṃvunāsusaṃghṛṣṭyaiḥ(---) pūjāṃmahātmune karavīraiścasaṃphullaiḥśvetaraktaiḥsugaṃdhibhiḥ
punnāgaiḥpuṣpakaiścaivamukulaiḥśatapatrakaiḥ jātībhirmallikābhiścakalhāraiḥkamalairapi pāṭalaiketakīpuṣpaiḥ
pūjayedraghunaṃdanaṃ vaiṣṇaveṣucasarveṣuśaṃkhapūjāṃprayatnataḥ kuryyāttrikālaṃvidhivadvidhijñaḥsādhakottamaḥ vi
nāpiśaṃkhapūjāyovaiṣṇaḥpūjayodvariḥ sasamyakpūjitopisyādapūjititidhruvaṃ dhūpaiścavahubhiḥsugaṃdhaiguggu
lodbhavaiḥ snehasaṃyuktavipulavartikyabhiradhekadhā āvartibhiranekābhiḥsthāpitabhiḥprayatnataḥ padmasvasti
karūpeṇahaṃsākāreṇavāpunaḥ bhrāmayedraghunāthasyapurastātpuratonvahaṃ naivedyabhakṣyabhojyādipūjitaṃpurata
sthitaṃ sūpāpūpaghṛtopetaṃpāyasāsādyaṃsuśarkaraṃ bahūpadaiśisaṃśobhisaghṛtaṃsadadhipriyaṃ nivedayetprayatne(-)
nasādhitaṃśuddhamujjvalaṃ karpūraśakalairyuktaṃpūgīphalamanoramaṃ tāṃvūlaṃraghunāthāyadattvākāmānavāpnuyāt
pūrvoktamevasaṃkṣepādvidhānaṃgaditaṃmune sarveṣāṃrāmamaṃtrāṇāṃevamevakṛtaṃpunaḥ trikālamekakālaṃvāyevaṃ
pūjayetsadā sārvabhaumeśvarobhūtvārāmevabhavediha || (44) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃpaṃcaviṃśo
dhyāyaḥ] || (25) || agastyuvāca sarvānuṣṭānasāraṃtesarvavānottamottamaṃ rahasyaṃkathayiṣyāmisutīkṣṇa
munisattama caitrenavamyāṃprākpakṣedivāpuṣpepunarvasau udayegurugaurāṃsesocasthegrahapaṃcake meṣapūṣāṇi

<pṛ0 37a> saṃprāptelagnekarkaṭakāhvake āvirāsītsakalayākauśalyāyāṃparaḥpumān tasmindinetukartavyamupavāsaṃvrataṃ
sadā tatrajāgaraṇaṃkuryyādraghunāthaparobhuvi prātardaśamyāṃkṛtvātusaṃdhyāyāṃkālikākriyāḥ saṃpūjyavidhivadrā
maṃbhaktyāvittānusārataḥ vrāhmaṇānmojayedbhaktyādakṣiṇābhiścatoṣayet gobhūtilahiraṇyādyaivastrālaṃkaraṇaistathā
rāmabhaktānprayatnenapūjayetparayāmudā evaṃyaḥkurutebhaktyāśrīrāmanavamīvrate anekajanmasiddhānipātakāni
bahūnyapi bhasmīkṛtyavrajatyevatadviṣṇoḥparamaṃpadaṃ sarveṣāmapyayaṃdharmobhuktimuktyaikasādhanaḥ aśucirvāpipā
piṣṭakṛtvedaṃvratamuttamaṃ pūjyaḥsyātsarvabhūtānāṃyathārāmastathaivasaḥ yasturāmanavamyāṃtubhuṃktesacanarādhamaḥ
kuṃbhīpākeṣucoreṣupacyatesanarādhamaḥ trailokyapāpamaśnātisadharmoniṣphalobhavet yasturāmasyanavamīmanā
dṛtyanarādhamaḥ nāstikyānnaparaṃgachedyāvadācaṃdratārakaṃ akṛtvārāmanavamīvrataṃsarvottamottamaṃ vratānyanyānikuru
tenateṣāṃphalabhāgbhavet rahasyakṛtapāpāniprakhyātānibahūnyapi mahāṃticapraṇaśyaṃtiśrīrāmanavamīvratā
t ekāmapinarobhūtvāśrīrāmanavamīṃmune upoṣyakṛtakṛtyaḥsyātsarvapāpaiḥpramucyate narorāmanavamyāṃtuśrīrā
mapratimāpradaḥ vidhānenamuniśreṣṭasamuktonātrasaṃśayaḥ || sutīkṣṇuvāca || śrīrāmapratimādānavidhānaṃca
kathaṃmune kathayatvaṃhirāmasyabhaktasyamamavistarāt agastyuvāca || kathayiṣyāmitadvidvanpratimādāna

<pṛ0 37ba> muttamaṃ vidhānaṃcāpiyatnenayatastvaṃvaiṣṇavottamaḥ aṣṭamyāṃcaitramāsetuśuklapakṣejitedriyaḥ daṃtadhāvanapūrvaṃtu
prātaḥsnāyādyathāvidhiḥ nadyāṃtaḍāgekūpevāhradeprasravaṇetathā tataḥsaṃdhyādikaṃkuryyānsaṃsmaranrāghavaṃhṛdi
gṛhamāgatyavipreṃdrakuryyādaumāsanādikaṃ dāṃtaṃkuṭuṃvinaṃvipraṃvedaśāstraparāyaṇaṃ śrīrāmapūjāṃnirataṃsuśīlaṃdaṃ
bhavarjitaṃ vidhijñaṃrāmamaṃtrāṇāṃrāmamaṃtraikasādhanaṃ āhūyabhaktyāvṛṇuyātsaṃpūjyaprārthayanniti śrīrāmapratimā
dānaṃkariṣyehaṃdvijottama tatrācāryobhavaprītaḥśrīrāmopitvamevame ityuktvājyenataṃvipraṃsnāpayitvātataḥparam
tailenābhyarcyasnāyāścaciṃtayanrāghavaṃhṛdi śvetāṃvaradharaḥśītagaṃdhamālyānidhārayan arcitobhūṣitaścaivakṛtamādhyā
hnikakriyaḥ ācāryyabhojayedbhaktyāsātvikānnaiḥsuvistaraṃ bhuṃjītasvayamapyaivaṃhṛdirāmamanusmaran ekabhuktava
tītatrasahācāryyodṛḍhavrataḥ śṛṇunāmakathāṃdivyāmahaḥśeṣaṃnayenmune sāyaṃsaṃdhyādikāḥkāryyātkriyārāmamanu
smaran ācāryyasahitastatraarthaḥśāyījiteṃdriyaḥsvapetsvayaṃsacaikāṃteśrīrāmārpitamānasaḥ tataḥprītaḥsamutthā
yasnātvāsaṃdhyāyathāvidheḥ prātaḥkarmāṇisarvāṇiśīghramevasamāpayet tataḥsvasthamanābhūtvāvidvadbhiḥsahito
nagha svagṛhecottaredeśedānasyottamamaṃḍapaṃ caturdvāraṃpatākādyaṃsavitānaṃsutoraṇaṃ manoramaṃmahotsedyaṃpuṣpā(-)
dyaiḥsamalaṃkṛtaṃ śaṃkhacakrahanūmadbhiḥprāgdvāresamalaṃkṛtaṃ garunmatśārṅgabāṇaiścadakṣiṇesamalaṃkṛtaṃ gadākhaṭvāṃ(-)

<pṛ0 38a> gadaiścaivapaścimesamalaṃkṛtaṃ padmasvastikanīlaiścakauveresamalaṃkṛtaṃ madyahastaṃcatuṣkādyaṃvedikāhastamāyataṃ
vṛttivāditragītaiścaanyaiścāpisusaṃyataṃ puṇyāhaṃvācayettatravidvadbhiḥprītamānasaḥ tataḥsaṃkalpayedevaṃrāma
mevasmaranmune asyāṃrāmanavamyāṃturāmādhanatatparaḥ upeṣyāṣṭasuyāmyeṣupūjayitvāyathāvidhiḥ imāṃsva
rṇamayīṃrāmapratimāṃsamalaṃkṛtāṃ śrīrāmaprītayedāsyerāmabhaktāyadhīmate prītorāmoharatvāśupāpānisuvahū
nime anekajanmasaṃsiddhānyabhyastānimahāṃtica tataḥsvarṇamayīrāmapratimāṃpalamānataḥ nirmitāṃhibhujāṃdi
vyāṃvāmāṃkasthitajānakī vibhratīṃdakṣiṇekarejñānamudrāṃmahāmune vāmeṇādhaḥkareṇāthadevīmāliṃgyasaṃsthitāṃ
siṃhāsanerājatetrapaladvayavinirmite tataḥpaṃcāmṛtasnānaṃsaṃpūjyavidhivattataḥ mūlamaṃtreṇaniyatonyāsapūrva
mataṃdritaḥ divaivaṃvidhivatkṛtvārātraujāgaraṇaṃtataḥ divyāṃrāmakathāṃśrutvārāmabhaktaiḥsamanvitaḥ nṛtyagītā
dibhiścaivarāmastotrairanekadhā pūjayanvidhivadbhaktyādivārātranayedvudhaḥ tataḥprātaḥsamutthāyasnānasaṃdhyādikāḥ
kriyāḥ samāpyavidhivadrāmaṃpūjayetsusamāhitaḥ tatohomaṃprakurvītamūlamaṃtreṇamaṃtravit pūrvoktapadmakuṃ
ḍevāsthaṃḍilevāsamāhitaḥ laukikāgnauvidhānenaśatamaṣṭottaraṃtataḥ sājyenapāyasenaivasmarannāmamananya
dhīḥ tutobhaktyāsusaṃtoṣyācāryyaṃpūjayenmune kuṃḍalābhyāṃsaratnābhyāmaṃgurīyairanekadhā gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatairvastraiḥ

<pṛ0 38ba> vicitraiḥsumanoharaiḥ tatorāmaṃsmarandadyādenaṃmaṃtramudīrayan imāṃsvarṇamayīṃrāmapratimāṃsamalaṃkṛtāṃ pītavastrayuga
channāṃrāmohaṃrāghavāyate śrīrāmaprītayedāsyerāmabhaktāyadhīmate prītorāmoharatvāśupāpānisubahūnyapi anye
bhyaścayathānyāyyaṃ gohiraṇyādiśaktitaḥ dadhyādvāsauyugaṃdhānyaṃyathāvibhavamāhitaḥ vrāhmaṇaiḥsahabhuṃjītatebhyoda
dyāścadakṣiṇāṃ vrahmahatyādipāpebhyomucyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ tulāpuruṣadānāniphalaṃprāpnotisuvrata anekajanmasaṃ
siddhapāpebhyomucyatedhruvaṃ bahūnākimihoktenamuktistasyakaresthitāḥ kurukṣetremahāpuṇyesūryaparvaṇyaśeṣataḥ
tulāpuruṣadānādyaiḥkṛtairyallabhatephalaṃ tatphalaṃlabhyatemartyairdānenānenasuvrata (56) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhi
tāyāṃṣaḍviṃśodhyāyaḥ] (26) || sutīkṣṇuvāca prāyeṇahinarāḥsarvedāridrāḥkṛpaṇāmune asamarthāhidānesmin 
kathaṃteṣāṃvadaprabho agastyuvāca aśaktāsumahābhāgasvasvavittānusārataḥ palārddhenatadardhenatadarddhārddhena(-)
vāpunaḥ vittaśāṭhyamakṛtvaivakuryyāddhetadvrataṃmune yadāghoratarāṃdraṣṭuṃyātanāṃnehatekvacit akiṃcinopiniya
mādupoṣyanavamīdine kṛtvājāgaraṇaṃbhaktyārāmabhaktaiḥsamanvitaḥ smaranrāmadhiyābhaktyāpūjayedvidhivanmune
japanrāmamanuṃmāyāramānaṃgasamanvitaṃ ekākṣaraṃvāvidhivatsarvanyāsakṛtonnatiḥ prātaḥsnātvācavidhivatkṛ(-)
tvāsaṃdhyādikāḥkriyāḥ gobhūtilahiraṇyādidadyādvittānusārataḥ śrīrāmacaṃdrabhaktebhyovidvadbhyaḥśraddhayānvitaḥ

<pṛ0 39a> pāraṇaṃcaprakurvītavrāhmaṇaiḥsahabhaktitaḥ yevaṃkurutebhaktyāḥsarvapāpaiḥpramucyate prāpteśrīrāmanavamīdinemartyo
vimūḍhadhīḥ upoṣaṇaṃnakurutekuṃbhīpākenimajjati yatkiṃcidrāmamuddiśyanodadātisvaśaktitaḥ sutīkṣṇuvāca
yāmāṣṭakeṣupūjāyaitvayāproktāmahāmune mūlamaṃtreṇacetyuktaṃtatkathaṃvadasuvrata agastyuvāca sarveṣāṃrāmamaṃ
trāṇaṃmaṃtrarājaṣaḍakṣaraḥ tārakavrahmacetyuktaṃtenapūjāpraśasyate daśamādhyāyavidhināpūjākāryyāprayatnataḥ 
dvārapīṭhāṃgadevānāmāvṛtīnāṃtathaivaca sannirodhanamevātra'vaguṃṭhanamaṃjasā tattanmudrābhirevaṃsyādevaṃsaprārthyabhakti
taḥ śaṃkhapūjāṃprakurvītapūrvoktavidhināmune kalaśaṃvāmabhāgasthaṃpūjādravyāṇicādarāt pātrasaṃprokṣayedbhaktyā
pyātmānaṃmanumuścaret pratiyāmaṃśaṃkhapūjākuryyādevamanusmaran pātrāsādhanamapyevaṃkuryyādyāmyeṣutaṃdritaḥ navāṃ
barāṇidevāyaprārthayattarpayetsudhīḥ svarṇayajñopavītānidadyāddevāyaśaktitaḥ nānāratnavicitrāṇidadyādā
bharaṇānica himāṃvughṛṣṭaruciraghanasārasamanvitaṃ gaṃdhaṃdadyātprayatnenasarāgaṃcasakuṃkumaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇasakalā
nupacārānprakalpayet kalhāraketakījātīpunnāgādyaiḥprapūjayet capakaiḥśatapatraiścasugaṃdhaiḥsumanoharaiḥ ghaṃ
ṭāṃcavādayandhūpaṃdīpaṃcāsmainivedayet bhakṣyabhojyādikaṃbhaktyādevāyavidhinārpayet evaṃsopaskaraṃdevaṃda(-)
tvāpāpaiḥpramucyate janmakoṭikṛtairghoraiḥ nānārūpaiḥsudāruṇaiḥ vimuktastatkṣaṇādevarāmevabhavenmune śradda

<pṛ0 39ba> dhānasyateproktaṃśrīrāmanavamīvrataṃ sarvalokahitārthāyapavitraṃpāpanāśanaṃ lohenanirmitāvāpiśilayādāru
ṇāpivā yenakenaprakāreṇayasmaikasmaikramānmune caitraśuklanavamyāṃtudatvāviprāyaśaktitaḥ mahādānādi
tulyaṃsyādrāmoddeśenakalpitā vittaśāṭhyamakṛtvaivasarvaṃkuryyātsubhaktitaḥ japedekāṃtāsīnayāvasyāddaśa(-)
mīdinaṃ tenaivasyātpuraścaryyāddaśamyāṃbhojayeddijān bhakṣyabhojyaibahuvidhaidadyācchaktyācadakṣiṇāṃ kṛtakṛtyo
bhavettenasadyorāmaḥprasīdatiḥ tūṣṇīṃtiṣṭannadhoyātipunarāvṛttigarbhitaṃ dvādaśāṣṭaśatenāpiyatpāpaṃnāpanudyate
vilayaṃyāṃtitatsarvaṃśrīrāmanavamīdine japaṃcarāmamaṃtrāṇāṃyonajānātitasyatu upoṣyacasmaranrāmaṃnyāsapūrva
mananyadhīḥ gurorlavdhamanuryyastutasyanyāsapuraḥsaraṃ yāmeyāmecavidhivatpūjāṃkāryyātsamāhitaḥ mumukṣavopi
hisadāśrīrāmanavamīvrataṃ mucyatesarvapāpebhyoyātivrahmasanātana || (34) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃsa
ptaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] || (27) || agastyuvāca || caitremāsinavamyāṃtujātorāmaḥsvayaṃhariḥ punarvasvarkṣusaṃyuktā
svalpāpiyadidṛśyate caitraśuklenavamyāṃtusāpuṇyāsarvakāmadā śrīrāmanavamīproktāsūryyakoṭigṛhādhikā
caitraśukletunavamīpunarvasuyutāyadi tasmindinemahāpuṇyerāmamuddiśyabhaktitaḥ yatkiṃcitkriyatekarmatadbha
vatpakṣayaṃśubhaṃ upoṣaṇaṃjāgaraṇaṃtasmātkuryyādviśeṣataḥ yasturāmanavamyāṃtudadyādvittānusārataḥ yatkiṃcida(-)

<pṛ0 40a> pitatsarvamahādānasamaṃbhavet yasturāmanavamyāṃtukuryyādrāmavrataṃyadi tulāpuruṣadānādiphalamāpnotimānavaḥsūrya
grahekurukṣetremahādānaiḥkṛtairmuhuḥ yatphalaṃtadavāpnotiśrīrāmanavamīvrataṃ kuryyādrāmanavamyāṃtuupoṣaṇamataṃdritaḥ mā
turgarbhamavāpnotinaivarāmobhavetsvayaṃ navamīcāṣṭamīvidvātyājyādviṣṇuparāyaṇaiḥ upoṣaṇaṃnavamyāṃtudaśamyāmevapāra
ṇaṃ nīlotpaladalaśyāmaṃpītāṃbaradharaṃvibhuṃ dvibhujaṃkāṃtanayanaṃdivyasiṃhāsanesthitaṃ vasiṣṭādyaiścaparitovṛttaṃratnaki
rīṭinaṃ sītāsaṃlāpacaturaṃdivyagaṃdhādiśobhitaṃ cāpadvayakareṇārātsevitaṃlakṣmaṇenava śatrughnabharatābhyāṃcapārśvayora
thasevitaṃ dhyāyannananyahṛdayodvādaśākṣaramanvahaṃ prajapedvīkṣitonityaṃśrīrāmanyāsapūrvakaṃ maṃtrasaṃdhyāṃvidhāyaivatrikā
laṃpūjayetsadā sutīkṣṇuvāca bhagavanyogināṃśreṣṭasarvaśāstraviśārada kiṃtattvaṃkiṃparaṃjāpyaṃkiṃjñānaṃmuktisā
dhanaṃ jñātumichāmitatsarvaṃvrūhimemunisattama agastyuvāca sutīkṣṇatvaṃmahābhāgaśṛṇuvakṣyāmitattvataḥyatpa
raṃyamunātītaṃyajyotiramalaṃphalaṃ tadevaparamaṃtattvaṃkaivalyapadakāraṇaṃ śrīrāmetiparaṃjāpyaṃtārakaṃbrahmasaṃjñitaṃ 
vrahmahatyādipāpaghnamitivedavidoviduḥ śrīrāmarāmarāmetiyevadaṃticasarvadā teṣāṃbhuktiścamuktiścabhaviṣya
tinasaṃśayaḥ namaskṛtyapravakṣyāmirāmakṛṣṇamanāmayaṃ ayodhyānagareramyeratnamaṃḍalamadhyage smaretkalpataromūle
ratnasiṃhāsanaṃśubhaṃ tanmadhyeṣṭadalaṃpadmaṃnānāratnapraveṣṭitaṃ sauvarṇaṃrājataṃvāpikārayedraghunaṃdanaṃ pārśvobharataśatru

<pṛ0 40ba> ghnochatracāmaradhāriṇau cāpadvayasamāyuktaṃlakṣmaṇākārayetsudhīḥ pituraṃkagataṃśyāmaṃmiṃdranīlasamaprabham ko
malāṃgaṃviśālākṣadvidyudvarṇāṃvarāṃvṛtaṃ bhānukoṭipratīkāśakirīṭinavirājitaṃ ratnagraiveyakeyūraratnakuṃḍalamaṃ
ḍitaṃ ratnakaṃkaṇamaṃjīrakaṭisūtrairalaṃkṛta śrīvatsakostubhoraskaṃmuktāhāropaśobhitaṃ sauvarṇerājatevāpiṣaṭ 
koṇaṃcasamullikhet abhāvevilvapīṭhecasthāpayedraghunaṃdanaṃ vastradvayasamāyuktaṃdivyaratnavibhūṣitaṃ aṣṭaśaktisa
māyuktaṃdeveśaṃpūjayetkramāt praṇavaṃpūrvamuścāryyanamaḥśavdaṃtatovadet bhagavatpadamābhāṣyavāsudevāyityapi
tataḥsarvabhūtātmaneyogapīṭhātmanenamaḥ itimaṃtreṇatanmadhyekuryyātpuṣpāṃjaliṃtataḥ evaṃsaṃpūjitepīṭedevamāvāhyapūja
yet arghāṃtadhūpadīpāṃtamupacārānvidhāyaca tatonujñāpyadeveśaparivārāṃcapūjayet sarvaṃṣaṭkoṇakoṣṭeṣuhṛdayā
dīnaṣaṭkramāt mūlamaṃtreṇakartavyoupacārāstuṣoḍaśa iṃdrādilokapālāṃścavasiṣṭādimunīnapi sarvadikpālamaṃtre
ṇapūjayedbhaktisaṃyutaḥ aśokakusumairyuktamarghyaṃdevasyadāpayet daśānanavadhārthāyadharmasaṃsthāpanāyaca dānavānāṃvi
nāśāyadaityānāṃnidhanāyaca paritrāṇāyasādhūnāṃrāmojātaḥsvayaṃhariḥ gṛhāṇārghaṃmayādattaṃbhrātṛbhiḥsahitonagha
pratiyāmaṃviśeṣeṇaarcayedraghunaṃdanaṃ purāṇaistotrapātraiścavedapārāyaṇenaca sunṛtyairgītavādyaiścarātriśeṣaṃvyapohya
ca prātasnātvācagāyatrīṃjaptvāsaṃdhyāmupāsyaca daśākṣareṇamaṃtreṇadeveśamanasāsmaret nyāsābahuvidhāḥproktāstvayā

<pṛ0 41a> devadevaṃpraṇamyāthapūrvavatpūjayeddhṛdi || (40) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃaṣṭāviṃśodhyāyaḥ] || (28) || sutīkṣṇa
uvāca sarvetihāsataḥprājñaśrutiḥsmṛtividāṃvara nyāsābahuvidhāproktāstvayādaumaṃtrayogataḥ tannāśaktaḥkathaṃkuryyā
tkathayasvamahāmune agastyuvāca nyāsaḥsyānmaṃtrasannāhonyāsahīnonasiddhidaḥ tasmānnyāsāḥprayatnenakartavyāḥ
siddhimichatā avaiṣṇavānāṃcamaṃtrāṇāṃsarveṣāṃcaviśeṣataḥ nyāsaḥkeśavakīrtyādistatvanyāsastataḥparaṃ nyāsaḥparama
haṃsākhyaḥpraṇavanyāsīritaḥ mātṛkāṃviṃdusaṃyuktāṃśuddhāṃmanmathasaṃyutāṃ māyāvedādisaṃyuktāṃpraṇavādiṃtathaivaca
ābhyaṃtarīmātṛkāṃcakṛtvānuṣṭānamācaret asyānuṣṭānamakhilaṃkartavyaṃmunisattama aśaktaścenmaṃtramātramuścaranniyato
nvahaṃ sarvānkāmānavāpnotisarāmorāmamāpnuyāt sutīkṣṇuvāca śrutaṃtvattomayāvrahmanrāmasyādbhutakarmaṇaḥ vidhā
naṃsarahasyaṃcapūjādīnāmanekaśaḥ daśākṣarādimaṃtrāṇāvidhānaṃcaviśeṣataḥ śataṃcavidhivatsamyagvrahmaprāptaikasādha
naṃ idānīṃśrotumichāmipratiṣṭāvidhimaṃjasā kadākutrakathaṃcetisarvajñastvāmatohime vrūhiśraddadhataḥsvāminyataṣkā
ruṇikobhavān agastyuvāca samyakpṛṣṭaṃtvayāvrahmanguhyādguhyataraṃparaṃ yaḥpaśyatiparāṃpuṇyāṃpratiṣṭāvidhivatkṛtāṃ
sopipuṇyatamolokepāpātsadyovimucyate śrīrāmasyapratiṣṭāyāḥphalaṃvaktuṃpitāmahaḥ naśaktaḥsyānmaheśopisahasra
vadanopica yenakenaprakāreṇayatrakutrāpivāmune yaiḥkaiścidvākṛtaṃcetsyāllokedhanyatamāhite kālapratīkṣānokuryyādvi

<pṛ0 41ba> dhiṃcāpiviśeṣataḥ yadaivabhaktirutpannātadāsthāpyoraghūdvahaḥ athavāhonavamyāṃtumāghaśuddhadinepica caṃdratārādi
saṃpannepratiṣṭāpyoraghūttamaḥ mārgaśīrṣethavāpūrṇevaiśākhevāsamāhita mūḍhādidoṣarahitepratiṣṭāṃrāghavasyatu pra
kuryyāccavidhānenabhaktyāśaktyāprayatnataḥ śrīgopālapratiṣṭāyāśrāvaṇaḥśasyatesadā narasiṃhasyavaiśākhekeśava
syāpiśasyate caitreturāmacaṃdrasyamāghecāpibalānvite anaṃtasyāpimāghesyādanyeṣāṃtuyathāruciḥ sarvakālepi
sarvatraprtiṣṭhāpyoraghūttamaḥ lagnaṃnatithivārovānanakṣatravalaṃtathā caitraśuklanavamyāṃtusthāpyorāmomumukṣubhiḥ
sarvānkāmānavāpnotimāgheśubhabalānvite kurvanśrīrāmacaṃdrasyapratiṣṭāṃbhāgyavānnaraḥ mārgaśīrṣecavaiśākhepyevame
vayathāvidhi sūryagrahemahāpuṇyekurukṣetrevidhānataḥ kṛtairyatpuṇyamāpnotitulāpuruṣakādibhiḥ tatpuṇyaṃprā
pnuyāmartyaḥpratiṣṭāpyaraghūttamaṃ yaḥkuryādrāmacaṃdrasyapratiṣṭāṃvidhivannaraḥ ehikānakhilānbhogānbhuktvānārāya
ṇobhavet varddhatecakulaṃbhūyaḥkalpakoṭiśatādhikaṃ nāpaṃḍitonavāmūrṣonadaridropitatkule nāvaiṣṇavopijāyaṃte
kadācidapikutracit 	lohenanirmitāvāpidāruṇāvāyathāvidhi kārayetpratimāṃramyāṃśrīrā
masyaśubhedine lakṣmaṇasyacasītāyāmāruteścaviśeṣataḥ sītāsvarṇanibhākāryyālakṣmaṇopitathābhavet
saṃśodhyadevatāgāraṃnirmāṇasthānamuttamaṃ śālāloṣṭādivarjyaṃcakuryyādyatnenaśodhayet khanetadbhadradeśaṃcata

<pṛ0 42a> lotpattiryathābhavet pāṣāṇasikatādyaiścapūrayetpūrvavatsudhīḥ kuṭṭimaṃcaprakurvītanirvāsasthānamuttamaṃ śalāloṣṭā
divarjyaṃ śuddharamyaśilopaṭṭairanekaiścasuvistaraiḥ devāvāsapradeśetupūrvavadbhūmikonnataṃ hastadvayottataṃkuryyātsu(-)
vistīrṇamanoharaṃ prākāraṃkārayettatracaturgopurasaṃyutaṃ pīṭhaṃramyaṃprakurvītaśilāyāṃcottamonnataṃ hastadvayāyataṃku
ryyāccaturasraṃsuśobhanaṃ agrabhāgehanūmaṃtaṃpīṭhasyavilikhenmune pīṭhaśuddhiṃprakurvītavakṣyamāṇavidhānataḥ likhedā
gneyivibhāgesugrīvaṃdvibhujaṃpunaḥ dakṣiṇebharataṃcaivanaiṛtecavibhīṣaṇaṃ paścimelakṣmaṇaṃcaivavāyavyeṃgadamevaca śa
trughnaṃcottarekuryyādīśānīṛkṣanāyakaṃ tataḥśrīrāmacaṃdraṃcapīṭhasyoparisaṃlikhet sauvarṇarājatevāpitāmrevāpiyathā
vidhiḥ śilāyāṃvāprakurvītacaturasraṃsuśobhanaṃ dvātriṃśadaṃgulaṃvāpiṣoḍaśāṃgulamevavā devasyasthāpanasthānetadyaṃ
traṃsthāpayenmune aṃkurārpaṇamādautusaptapaṃcatrivāsare yathāvidhiprakurvītacaṃdratārābalānvite gaṇeśaprārthanaṃkuryyā
tsarvavighnopaśāṃtaye sauvarṇapratimāṃpūjyavastradvayasamanvitāṃ kuṭiṃbinedaridrāyavrāhmaṇāyanivedayet ekākṣaragaṇe
śasyadhyānamārgeṇayatnataḥ śrīrāmapratimācāpidaśākṣaravidhānataḥ anuṣṭubhenavācāpidvādaśākṣaramārgataḥ yenakenā
pimārgeṇakārayedvidhivanmune || (37) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāmūnatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || (29) || sutīkṣṇu
vāca kathaṃdaśākṣarādīnāṃmārgovaimunisattama vyācakṣvasarahasyaṃmetvayibhaktasyasattama agastyuvāca || sādhuvakṣyā

<pṛ0 42ba> misatyaṃteśṛṇuṣvāvahitomama sītālaṃkṛtavāmāṃkaṃdvibhujaṃcāhalocanaṃ vāmahastenasītāyāḥspṛśaṃtaṃstanamaṃḍalaṃ 
jñānamudrāyatenānyenārpitaṃlokasuṃdaraṃ dhanurddharayapunāpilakṣmaṇenasuśobhitaṃ koṭikaṃdarpasaṃkāśaṃrāghavaṃkaruṇāka
raṃ upaviṣṭaṃpadmamadhyevīrāsanamanoharaṃ hanumatsevitaṃcāgrekuryyādevaṃmanoharaṃ daśākṣaroyaṃkathitovidhināmunipuṃga(-)
vaiḥ nīlotpaladalaśyāmaṃpītāṃbaradharaṃvibhuṃ dvibhujaṃkaṃjanayanaṃdivyasiṃhāsanesthitaṃ vaśiṣṭādyaiḥparivṛtaṃhāraratna
kirīṭinaṃ sītāsaṃlāpacaturaṃdivyagaṃdhādiśobhitaṃ cāpadvayakareṇārātsevitaṃlakṣmaṇenaca śatrughnabharatābhyāṃca
pārśvayorupaśobhitaṃ dhyāpayannanadhīrāmaṃdvādaśākṣaramanvahaṃ prajapeddīkṣitonityaṃśrīrāmaṃnyāsapūrvakaṃ maṃtrasaṃdhyāvi
dhāyaivatrikālaṃpūjayetsadā krīḍaṃtaṃsītayāsākaṃnīlajīmūtasannibhaṃ vṛṣākapīṃdrakrurddhayaṃvasiṣṭenasmṛtaṃvibhuṃ tadvadhā
yasusaumitrecāpavāṇagṛhoditaṃ cāpadvayabhṛtāpaścāllakṣmaṇenasuśobhitaṃ sarvalokahitodyuktaṃpītāṃbaradharaṃvibhuṃ dhyā
yansaptākṣaraṃjaptvāsarvapāpaiḥpramucyate sajalāṃvudasaṃkāśaṃdhanurvāṇakaraṃmune dhyāyannaṣṭākṣaraṃjaptvārāmevabhavettataḥ jñāna
mudrālaṃsaṃbāhuṃhanumatsevitaṃpunaḥ śatrughnabharatābhyāṃcalakṣmeṇenasamāvṛtaṃ dhyāyannekākṣaraṃjaptvābhukterbhavatibhājanaṃ 
anyāścamūrtayaḥsaṃtibahvovaimunisattama āsāmanyatamāmūrtīḥsthāpanīyāprayatnataḥ maṃtrāścavaiṣṇavāuktvāmūla
maṃtrasyamaṃjasā devasyāpiprakurvītatatohanumataḥparaṃ prāṇapratiṣṭāttannyāsānyathāvidhivicakṣaṇaḥ lakṣmaṇasyā

<pṛ0 43a> pimaṃtrasyatatodevasyamāruteḥ śatrughnabharatādīnāṃkuryyādyatnenadaiśikaḥ || sutīkṣṇuvāca lakṣmaṇādimanūnāṃcavi
dhānaṃlakṣmaṇaṃmune vaktumarhasimesarvaṃbhaktasyedaṃdayānidhe agastyuvāca śṛṇuvakṣyāmitesarvaṃsuvistaramanekadhā
rephapūrvaṃsamuddhṛtyabiṃdulakṣmaṇasaṃyutaṃ ṅetoyaṃlakṣmaṇamanuttamasācasamanvitaḥ ṛṣiḥsyānmahamevāsyagāyatryaṃchaṃducya
te lakṣmaṇodevatāproktālaṃvījaṃśaktirasyahi namastuviniyogohipuruṣārthacatuṣṭaye dvibhujaṃsvarṇaruciratanuṃpadmani
bhekṣaṇaṃ dhanurvāṇakaraṃrāmasevāsaṃsaktamānasaṃ rāmavatsvarṇapīṭhastumūrmileśamahaṃbhuje pūjāpivaiṣṇavīproktāsāṃgāvaraṇavarji
te saptalakṣapuraścaryātataḥsiddhistusādhayet devyāstupūrvamevoktaṃ saharāmeṇatadbhavet bharatasyaivamevāsyaśatrughnasyāpyayaṃ
vidhiḥ śrīrāmapūjāniratametenavijayetsadā ādauvāpyaṃtatovāpipūjāyārāghavasyatu eteṣāmapikartavyabhuktimukti
phalepsubhiḥ prādhānyenapṛthaktvenaaṃgatverāmapīṭhake hanūmatopyevamevapūjāṃkuryyādataṃdritaḥ pūrvaṃnamaḥpadaṃcoktvā
tatohanumatepadaṃ āṃjaneyapadaṃṅetaṃmahāvalapadaṃtathā vahnijāyāṃtevasyānmaṃtrohanumataḥparam sarvasiddhikaraḥpro
ktaṃsarveṣāmapisiddhidaḥ mālākhyaḥparamomaṃtromārutaḥsarvasiddhidaḥ lakṣmaṇastusadāpūjyaḥprādhānyenaivanityaśaḥ
vaiṣṇavaṃnyāsajālaṃtusarvaṃkṛtvāsamāhitaḥ bhūtaśuddhiṃvidhāyaivamātṛkāmapiyatnataḥ vidhāyamānasīpūjāṃbāhyapūjā
mapisvayaṃ trikālamekakālaṃvānityamekāṃtasevitaḥ sāphalyarāmapūjāyāṃyadīchatisavaijanaḥ tenayatnenakartavyā

<pṛ0 43ba> lakṣmaṇastusuvistarāt śrīrāmamaṃtrabhedāstubahavaḥsaṃtivaimune tatsādhakaiḥsadākāryāsaumitrerapinityaśaḥ pa
raṃvrahmāpilokesmiyathāsevyomumukṣubhiḥ tathaivalakṣmaṇamanusadāsevyobhavediha daśākṣarādimaṃtrāṇāṃsāphalya
mapivāṃchatā sevyoyaṃhisadāmaṃtrehikāmuṣmikapradaḥ ajaptvālakṣmaṇamanurāmamaṃtraṃjapaṃtiye tajjāpyasyaphalaṃ
naivaprayāṃtikuśalāpi arimitravivekopinaivakāryyobhavediha rāmapūjāparairnityaṃsadāsevyoyamaṃjasā yojayela(-)
kṣmaṇamanuṃnityamekāṃtamāsthitaḥ mucyatesarvapāpebhyaḥ sakāmānaśrutekhilāt manovākkāyakarmotthairabhyastairapya
nekadhā mahadbhirapipāpaughaimucyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ sarvānkāmānavāpnotiviṣṇoḥparaṃpadaṃ (44) [itiśrīagasti
saṃhitāyāṃtriṃśodhyāyaḥ] (30) || agastyuvāca puroditasyamaṃtrasyaprayogamapicāṃjasā kathayāmiyathāśaktiḥsara
hasyaṃsuvistaraṃ prayogāyaivamaṃtroyamupadiṣṭohiśārgiṇā arjunasyapurāsamyagetenaivadhanaṃjayaḥ diśovijityasa
kalāḥśatrūṃścaivabahūnyapi prāttiṣṭayaddharmarājaṃpaitṛkerājyuttame jayapradhānomaṃtroyaṃrājyaprāślaikasādhanaṃ yojayenni
yatomaṃtralakṣamekaṃsamāhitaḥ socirānnaṣṭarājyaḥsanprāpnotyaivanasaṃśayaḥ abhiṣiktamayodhyāyāṃdhyāyenrāmrāmamana
nyadhīḥ paṃcāyutamimaṃjaptvānaṣṭarājyamavāpnuyāt nāgapāśavinirmuktadhyāyannekāṃtāsthitaḥ ayutaṃprajapan 
mucyennigaḍādyaistathaivahi āṃjanīyasamānītamahauṣadhigatavyathaṃ dhyāyennayutajāpyenaapamṛtyujayennaraḥ iṃdraji

<pṛ0 44a> tprāṇahaṃtāraṃdhyāyannevasamāhitaḥ durjayaṃcāpivegenajayedvairikulaṃbahu sūryyanakhāstānāsāgrachedanodyuktamāna
saṃ dhyāyansahasrajāpyenapuruhūtādikānjayet rāmapādāvjasevārthanityasatvamanusmaran japattadyutamekāṃtemahā
rogānvahūnapi kṣayāpasmārakuṣṭādināśayatyevatatkṣaṇāt trimāsaṃniyatāhārojapetsaptasahasrakaṃ dinedine
vidhānenapūjayedvijiteṃdriyaḥ aṣṭottaraśataiḥpuṣpaiḥnichidraiḥśatapatrakaiḥ pāyasaṃśarkaropetaṃnaivedyaṃvidhivanmune
ghanasārasamāyuktaṃcaṃdanaṃnānulipyaca devodaśenanityaṃcasaṃpūjyaivaṃdvijottamaḥ kuṣṭarogānpramucyetaduścikitsā
danekaśaḥ tvagdoṣajābahuvidhāḥmaṃḍalādiprabhedakāḥ tesarvenāśamāyāṃtiduścikitsāpikṣaṇāt ekāṃteniya
tāhāraḥṣaṇmāsānvijiteṃdriyaḥ japannevavidhānenakṣayarogātpramucyate māṣāpūpānnanaivedyaijapenmaṃtraṃsamāhitaḥ 
vātarogānpramucyetabahubhedādapikṣaṇāt abhimaṃtryajalaṃnityaṃmaṃtreṇatriḥsamāhitaḥ pītvāsaṃdhyāsusaṃbhaktyā
mucyatesarvarogataḥ dāridryaṃnāśayitvātuśriyamāpnotyanuttamāṃ viṣādidoṣasaṃsparśonabhaveccakadācana prakṣā(-)
lyaivapratidinaṃmukhaṃbhaktyāsamāhitaḥ mukhanetrādisaṃbhūtānjayedrogānsudāruṇān pītvābhimaṃtritajalaṃ
kukṣirogānvahūnjayet devasyapratimādānaṃkṛtvābhaktyāvidhānataḥ sarvebhyopyatharogebhyomucyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ kanyā(-)
rthīcormilāpāṇīgrahaṇīsaktamānasaṃ dhyāyanlakṣaṃjapitvātuhutvālājairdaśāṃsataḥ īpsitāṃprāpnuyātkanyāṃśīghrameva

<pṛ0 44ba> tapodhana dīkṣitaṃstaṃbhanātstrīṇāṃmaṃtreṣuniyatavrataḥ saṃsmaranvidhivannityaṃmāsatrayamananyadhīḥ pūjāpuraḥsa
raṃsaptasahasraniyatreṃdriyaḥ japannikhilavidyānāṃtattvajñobhavatidhruvaṃ viśvāmitrakratuvarekratvādbhutaparākramaṃ dhyāya
nnayutajāpyenabhayebhyomucyatecirāt saṃdhyāṃcopāsyavidhivanmūlamaṃtreṇamaṃtravit trikālaṃniyatobhūtvākṛta(-)
nityavidhiḥsvayaṃ dīkṣāyutoyathānyāyaṃgurvanujñāpuraḥsaraḥ mucyatesarvapāpebhyoyātiviṣṇauḥparaṃpadaṃ ehikāna
nayaṃtyevaniṣkāmoyārcayeddhariṃ dīkṣāṃprāpyavidhānenagurorvigatakalmaṣāt svācāraniratādvātādgṛhasthādvijiteṃ(-)
driyāt tadanujñānasāreṇapuraścaryyāyathāvidhiḥ sasarvānpuṇyapāpaughāndagdhānirmalamānasaḥ punarāvṛttirahi
taṃśāśvataṃpadamāpnuyāt sakāmovāṃchitānkāmānbhuktvābhogānmanoramāt jātismaraściraṃbhūtvāyātiviṣṇoḥparaṃ
padaṃ yathāśrīrāmamaṃtrāṇāṃprayoktaḥpāpasaṃbhavaḥ natathālakṣmaṇamanoḥkiṃtuyāṃtiparāṃgatiṃ maṃtroyaṃvrahmaṇāpūrvaṃtu
ṣṭenamanasāciraṃ sūryagrahekurukṣetremahyaṃdattohisādaraṃ mayopyupāsitoyaṃvaibhaktiyuktenacetasā gurubhaktisamālokya
māmevāsyātkarodṛṣiḥ upāsyabahavolokemanumetamanekaśaḥ saṃprāpyavāṃchitānarthānagamadvaiṣṇavaṃpadaṃ nānenasadṛ
śomaṃtromayādṛṣṭohikutracit śaivavaiṣṇavaśaireṣugāṇapatyeṣuvāmune kecittuṣṭyarthamevasyuḥkecidauhikasādhanāḥ
bhuktimuktipradaścāyamekovijayateparaṃ (40) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāmekatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] (31) || sutī(-)

<pṛ0 45a> kṣṇuvāca sarvavedārthatattvajñamuneniścitamānasaḥ samyaksaṃśikṣitaṃścāhaṃbahudhāpikṛpālunā tvayākāruṇyani
dhināpūrvamajñastathājaḍaḥ tvatprasādenasaṃjātajñānosmigatakalmaṣaḥ rāmātmaṃniparaṃvrahmaṇyāsaktaṃmamamānasaṃ lakṣma
ṇepitathārāmekiṃcidvedostinaivahi hanumanmaṃtrityuktatvayāvaimunipuṃgava tasyānuṣṭānamevāhaṃjñātumichāmiteprabhoḥ 
tvayiprasannesakalemācakṣusudayānidhe agastyuvāca smāritaḥsamyagevāhaṃtvayāśraddhāvatāmune āṃjaneyamanu
rlokebhuktimuktyaikasādhanaṃ prakāśitaḥśaṃkareṇalokānāṃhitamichatā bhūtapretapiśācādiḍākinyovrahmarākṣa
sāḥ dṛṣṭvācaprapalāyaṃtemaṃtrānuṣṭānatatparaṃ ṛṣirīśvarevasyādanuṣṭupchaṃducyate hanumāndevatāproktāhavī
jaṃśaktiraṃtyajaiḥ kīlakaṃhātrayaṃproktaṃvedakaṃtuhasaupunaḥ hanumatprīṇanaṃcaivaphalamādyamudīritaṃ sarvepsitānāṃdātṛtva
masyaivājinacānyataḥ praṇavaṃpūrvamuścāryyanamobhagavatepadaṃ ḍeṃtaṃprakaṭasaṃyuktaṃparākramapadaṃtathā yathākrāṃtapadope
taṃdikmaṃḍalamudīrayet yaśovitānadhavalīkṛtajagatṛtīyakaṃ vajredeheticapadaṃrudrāvatārapadaṃtathā saṃvudvyaṃtaparāṃlaṃ
kāpurīdahanamīrayet udadhirlaṃghanaṃcāpidaśagrīvakṛtāṃtakṛt sītāyāśvāsanapadaṃmaṃjanīgarbhasaṃbhavaḥ śrīrāma
lakṣmaṇānaṃdakarakapisainyaprākāra sugrīvasādhāraṇapadaṃsarvatoccāṭanaṃtathā vālavrahmacārinnititathāgaṃbhīraśavda
padaṃtathā ḍākinīdhvaṃsanapadaṃtatastāramudīrayet māyāhātrayamuścāryabhasmannehivadettataḥ sarvaviṣaṃharapahabalaṃkṣo

<pṛ0 45ba> bhayamesarvakāryyāṇisādhayetidviruścaret hūṃphaṭsvāhetimaṃtroyaṃmālākhyaḥsarvakāmadhuk namobhagavatecāṃjane
yāyetyaṃguṣṭābhyāmudīritaḥ rudramūrtayityevatarjanībhyāmanaṃtaraṃ     rāmapūtāyacatathākaniṣṭābhyāṃvicakṣaṇaḥ
vrahmāstranivāraṇāyacatathāstramaṃtroyamīritaḥ evaṃṣaḍaṃgaṃcamunekṛtvādhyāyedananyadhīḥ sphuṭikābhaṃsvarṇakāṃ
tiṃdvibhujaṃcakṛtāṃjaliṃ kuṃḍaladvayasaṃśobhirmukhāṃbhojaṃmuhurmuhuḥ ayutaṃtupuraścaryārāmasyāgreśivasyavā pūjāṃca
vaiṣṇavepīṭheśaivevāvidadhītavā āvṛttibhipunarnityaṃnaktāśīvijiteṃdriyaḥ kṣudraroganivṛttyarthamaṣṭottaraśataṃmune
dinatrayamathojaptvābhūtānāṃmucyatebhayāt bhūtapretapiśācādiśāṃtayoṣṭottaraṃśataṃ japtvācatanbhayānmuktobhavatyeva
nasaṃśayaḥ mahārogādiśāṃtyarthamaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ japtātasmātpramucyetaniścitaṃniyatāśanaḥ jayābhikāṃkṣiṇāṃ
rājñāmasmādanyonavidyate dhyāyedrākṣasahaṃtāraṃniyataṃniyatāśanaḥ japenniyamavāṃścaivajayeddurjayamapyariṃ saṃdhānā
yatusugrīvasaṃdhātāraṃsmarannapi ayutenaivavalināsaṃdhimāpnotyasaṃśayaḥ laṃkāyādāhakaṃdhyāyejjapannayutamaṃjasā
śatrurāṣṭraṃdahatyevadugdhāvdimapicānagha jayārtheripusiṃhānāṃasyādanyonavidyate yastugehehanūmaṃtaṃsarvadaiva
prapūjayet vadaṃtetasyamaṃtreṇatasyalakṣmīracaṃcalā dīrghamāyurbhavedevaṃsarvatravijayībhavet mayādibhūtasaṃkṣo
bhataddeśenaivajāyate śaivānāṃvaiṣṇavānāṃcaṣaṭkramotrapradarśitaḥ nānyatsādhanamastyevamaṃtrādasmāddhanūmataḥ

<pṛ0 46a> caurevyāghragajādīnāmayamevaparāyaṇaṃ parāpahṛtarājyānāṃvādhitānāṃparaiḥpunaḥ sannāhabhājepuruṣaṃyuddhāyapa
rasainikaḥ yātrākālehanūmaṃtaṃsmaranyastusvakādgṛhāt nirgachatisavegeniṣṭārthamadhigacchati svāpakā
lesmarennityaṃcaurabhūtāndikānjayet || (40) || [itiśrīagastisaṃhitāyāṃdvātriṃśodhyāyaḥ] (32) || 
[samāptoyaṃgraṃthaḥ] || 


